{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "8#0", "task_desc": "Hello, my name is Sophia Silva. I recently took a flight from Chicago (ORD) to Philadelphia (PHL) on May 10, and I\u2019d like to book the exact same flight again, but for May 26. It should be a one-way trip. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is sophia_silva_7557. With that, can you pull up my recent May 10 flight from ORD to PHL so we can book the exact same one for May 26?\nYes, the date of birth you have on file for me is correct \u2014 since it\u2019s already in my profile, I\u2019ll just confirm that\u2019", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Sophia! I'd be happy to help you book a flight from Chicago (ORD) to Philadelphia (PHL) for May 26, 2024, as a one-way trip.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `sophia_silva_123`). Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"reg