{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel a booking I have with you. The reservation code is EHGLP3.\nSure, my user ID is emma_kim_9957. As for the reason \u2014 I was out of town right after I booked it, so it's been a bit more than 24 hours, but I wasn't able to deal with it until now. I'd like to cancel the reservation EHGLP3.\nWait, that doesn't sound right to me. When I booked this, I was told explicitly that I didn't need to purchase insurance this time because my previous trip was booked through the same agency an", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To proceed with the cancellation, I'll need a couple of details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide these?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation EHGLP3 and the cancellation policy. Unfortunately, I'm unable to process this cancellation because none of the conditions that permit cancellation are met:\n\n- **Booking age:** Your reservation was created on 2024-05-04, which is more than 24 hours ago (current date is 2024-05-15).\n- **Airline cancellation:** Both flights (HAT156 and HAT021 on 2024-05-17) currently show as \"available\" \u2014 they have not been cancelled by the airline.\n- **Cabin class:** The reservation is in **basic economy**, not business.\n- **Travel insurance:** The reservation does not include travel insurance.\n\nPer our policy, a flight can only be cancelled (without any portion having been flown) if one of the following is true: the booking was made within the last 24 hours, the flight was cancelled by the airline, it is a business-class booking, or you have travel insurance covering the reason. Since none of these apply, I", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T19:53:16"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to my upcoming return trip. I've currently got a one-stop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I'd like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new \u2014 just want to modify my existing reservation.\nI understand your policy, but the whole point of my call is to change my destination from Los Angeles to Las Vegas \u2014 not to keep the same route. If that's not something you're able to do under your modification ru", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. However, I need to clarify a few things first.\n\nTo locate and modify your reservation, I'll need your **user ID** and **reservation ID**. If you don't have your reservation ID handy, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\n\nAlso, I should note an important policy constraint: reservations can be modified **without changing the origin, destination, and trip type**. Since you'd like to change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), that change would not be permitted under our modification policy. Modifications are limited to changing flights (same origin/destination/trip type), cabin class, baggage, insurance, or passenger details \u2014 but the route and trip type must stay the same.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can look up your reservation? And if you'd like, I can help you explore what modifications *are* possible (such as changing to a nonstop flight on the same ATL\u2192LAX route, or changing cabin class).", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T19:53:16"}
