{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#0", "task_desc": "I need to get a passenger removed from my upcoming trip \u2014 Sophia needs to be taken off my round trip flights from LAS to Denver, departing May 19 and returning May 20. I\u2019m in a bit of a hurry, so can we get this done fast?\nUgh, this is exactly what I didn't want to hear \u2014 I told you I'm in a rush! If you absolutely can't remove Sophia from the booking, then just downgrade all passengers on the reservation to basic economy. \n\nMy name is James Patel, user ID is james_patel_9828. I don't have the r", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to remove a passenger from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 you may update passenger details (such as names or dates of birth), but adding or removing passengers is not permitted. This applies even if you were transferred to a human agent.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications that don't change the passenger count, such as updating Sophia's passenger details, changing flights, changing cabin class, or adding checked bags. Please let me know if you'd like to proceed with any of those, and I'll need your user ID and reservation ID to assist.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\",