{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious right now. I had a business flight with you guys earlier this month that got canceled, and because of that cancellation I ended up missing a really important meeting. This whole situation caused me a huge amount of inconvenience and I expect to be properly compensated for it \u2014 not just some generic apology email.\nLook, I don't have that reservation number on me right now, but my account ID is sophia_silva_7557 \u2014 that should pull up my info. And I'll say it again, I need r", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience caused by the flight cancellation. To confirm the facts and assist you with compensation, I'll need to look up your reservation details.\n\nCould you please provide me with your **user ID** and **reservation ID**? If you don't know your reservation ID, just let me know your user ID and I can help locate it.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\