{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I recently called your support line and the representative I spoke with said that a service agent like yourself would be able to assist me with cancelling my booking. I'd like to get that started.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340. I'm afraid I don't have the reservation ID handy right now, but hopefully you can pull up my bookings with that.\nI'd like to cancel the reservation **Q69X3R** \u2014 that's the round trip with the Philadelphia (PHL) to LaGuardia (LGA) flights. As for the reason, ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your booking. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like 'sara_doe_496'). \n\nIf you also have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"d