{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, hello. I am Amelia Davis. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I need to give up my seats for someone else who may need them.\nAh, oui, my user ID is amelia_davis_8890. As I said, I want to cancel all of my flights because I wish to give up my seat for someone else who needs it, vous comprenez? I do not know the reservation numbers, but you can find them with my ID, non?\nOui, yes, please go ahead and cancel the two you mentioned \u2014 8C8K4E and LU15PA. But als", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. To get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID? (For example, it looks like \"sara_doe_496\".)\n\nIf you don't know your reservation IDs, I can help locate them once I have your user ID. I'll also need the reason for cancellation.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}, \"credit_card_5799376\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\