{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "2#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm looking to book a flight from San Francisco to New York. There will be three of us traveling.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847. We're thinking a one-way trip, economy cabin, for the three passengers. \n\nBut actually \u2014 wait, I'm sorry, I need to switch gears here. I'm really frustrated and want to talk about something else. My most recent reservation had a delayed flight and I'm pretty upset about how that was handled.\nOh, I see \u2014 I guess I was wrong about it being my most recent re", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a flight from San Francisco (SFO) to New York (JFK) for 3 passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\n\nI'll also need a few more details to complete the booking:\n- **Trip type**: one way or round trip?\n- **Cabin class**: basic economy, economy, or business?\n- **Travel date(s)**\n- **Passenger details** for all 3 travelers: first name, last name, and date of birth for each\n- **Payment method(s)** already on your profile\n\nPlease provide your user ID first, and we can go from there.\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delayed flight \u2014 let me look into your account to find your most recent reservation and the details around that delay.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"cred