{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Look, I'm dealing with some money troubles right now and honestly I'm pretty upset about it, but I need to downgrade all of my business class flights to economy. I don't want to change any of the flights or the passengers\u2014just the cabin class. Can you help me sort this out?\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. Name's Omar Davis. Just get me downgraded to economy on everything, okay? I'm not in the mood to mess around with this.\nYes, fine, go ahead and do it. I already said I'm not changing", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear you're going through a tough time. I can help you downgrade the cabin class from business to economy without changing the flights or passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you, Omar. Let me look up your profile and reservations to find the booking(s) you'd like to modify.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"fir