{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Aarav Garcia. I need to change my upcoming flight from Atlanta to Philadelphia. I want to move it to the day after my original reservation, and I'm looking for the cheapest Economy cabin fare that isn't Basic Economy. Also, I live in Princeton, so arriving in Newark instead of Philly would work just as well for me.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me, but hopefully you can pull up my booking with that.\n\nAnd thanks for explaining the", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you modify your flight. \n\nBefore I proceed, I need a few details:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `aarav_garcia_123`) \u2014 this is required to access your profile and reservations.\n2. **Your reservation ID** \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nAlso, I should note an important policy constraint: when modifying a reservation, the **origin, destination, and trip type cannot be changed**. This means I would not be able to change your arrival city from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR) as part of a flight modification. If you'd like to fly into Newark instead, that would require a new booking rather than a modification.\n\nPlease provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it), and let me know how you'd like to proceed regarding the destination.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_747372