{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm really upset right now. My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle has been delayed and I want to know exactly why this happened. This is completely unacceptable!\nLook, I don't have the exact date of the flight memorized right now, but my user ID is ethan_martin_2396 and I'm Ethan Martin. The flight was HAT039 from ATL to SEA as I mentioned.\n\nI'm extremely frustrated \u2014 I deserve to know why this flight was delayed! You're saying you can't see the reason through your system? Then I need to ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your frustration. I can check the status of flight HAT039 for you, but I'll need the date of the flight to look it up. Could you please provide the date (in YYYY-MM-DD format)?\n\nAlso, please note that I can confirm the flight's status through my system, but the specific reason for a delay is not information available to me through my tools. If you'd like, I can also help you with changing or cancelling the reservation, or look into compensation options if applicable.\n\nCould you also provide your user ID so I can locate your reservation?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_2942955\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": 