{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Raj Brown. I\u2019m calling because I\u2019ve been having some health issues and I had purchased trip insurance for my booking. I\u2019d like to change my reservation VA5SGQ \u2014 right now it\u2019s a roundtrip from DTW to LGA \u2014 to nonstop flights from DTW to JFK and back on the same dates. Since I have the insurance, I need the change fees waived. I\u2019m only interested in early flights that get in before 7am at the destination, and I want the cheapest regular Economy (not Basic Economy) choices that meet th", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you look into changing your reservation. Let me first pull up the details for VA5SGQ to verify the booking and find your user ID.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you, Raj. I've pulled up reservation **VA5SGQ** (user ID: `raj_brown_5782`). Here is what I found:\n\n- **Trip type:** round trip\n- **Cabin:** Economy\n- **Travel insurance:** yes\n- **Booked:** 2024-05-08\n- **Current routing:** DTW \u2192 LGA outbound on 2024-05-17 (via PHX) and LGA \u2192 DTW return on 2024-05-19/20 (via PHX). This is a **connecting** itinerary, not nonstop.\n\nRegarding your request: per our modification policy, a reservation can be modified **only without changing the origin, destination, or trip type**. Changing the destination from LGA to JFK would alter the destination, which is **not permitted as a modification**.\n\nBecause the change you're requesting (destination LGA \u2192 JFK) cannot be completed through a modification, and would instead require canceling and rebooking or other handling, I'm transferring you to a human agent who can review your options with you.\n\nConnecting you now.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassista", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T19:53:16"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "I... I'm sorry... I need to change my flight... something terrible happened yesterday and I just can't... can't travel on the date I had booked. I need to move it out a couple of days, please... I'm just so lost right now.\nMy... my name is Lucas Brown. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. The reservation is EUJUY6... I booked it for me and my wife... but she... she passed away yesterday. I can't go on the original date. I need to move it out two days. Please, I just can't cancel it, I just need a dif", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear you're going through a difficult time. I'll do my best to help you change your flight.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a couple of details:\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\").\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, something like \"ZFA04Y\"). If you don't have your reservation ID handy, let me know and I can help locate it using your user ID.\n\nOnce I have those, I can look up your reservation and help you move the flight to a new date.\nassistant: I'm very sorry for your loss. I can help you change the flight date. Let me look up your reservation and profile details first.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 