{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need some help with my flight bookings. I have a few upcoming reservations and I'd like to cancel two of them, and also upgrade a third one to business class.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699.\nThanks for pulling those up. Based on what I need, the two reservations I'd like to cancel are **IFOYYZ** and **NQNU5R**. The one I want to upgrade to business class is **M20IZO** \u2014 it's currently in economy with 2 passengers.\n\nI did see your note about NQNU5R's flights already having taken place", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with that. To get started, I'll need your user ID so I can look up your reservations. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have 4 reservations: M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R. Let me pull up the details of each so we can identify which ones you'd like to cancel and which to upgrade.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"N6F783\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 11, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T19:53:16"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Sofia. I need to change the return flight for my Houston to Denver trip. The departure is on May 27, and I need to switch the return to the fastest possible option on that same day, counting any layover time too. This is urgent, so I\u2019d really like to get it sorted ASAP.\nSure, my user ID is sofia_kim_7287. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but you said you can locate it with that. And just to stress, this is really urgent, so I'd appreciate if we could move quickly.\nYes, please go ahe", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hi Sofia! I'd be happy to help you change your return flight. To get started, I'll need a couple of details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sofia_xxx_123`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., `ZFA04Y`). If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certificate_9932251\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\"