{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm having an issue with my upcoming flight booking. I'm traveling with my family, and I'm certain I selected travel insurance for my ticket when I booked, but when I check my reservation online, it doesn't show any insurance for me. My husband and kids all have their insurance listed, so I really need to get insurance added to my flight as well. Can you help me sort this out?\nWell, I really need this taken care of, not just reviewed. My user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and my reservation nu", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to add travel insurance to your reservation at this time. According to our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made. This applies to all reservations, and I'm not able to modify insurance details once a booking is confirmed.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications to your reservation, such as updating baggage or flight details, or I can look into the details of your existing reservation to verify the current insurance status for all passengers. Please let me know your user ID and reservation ID if you'd like me to review the booking.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I can see why you'd want to be covered like the rest of your family. However, I must be clear about our policy: travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made. This is a firm policy rule that applies to all reservations, and I do not have the ability to modify or add insurance details once a booking is confirmed \u2014 even in cases where there may appear to be a discrepancy in the record.\n\nI'm not able to \"make it happen\" within the constraints I operate under, as adding insurance post-booking is explicitly not permitted.\n\nIf you believe there was a system error where your insurance was selected at booking but not properly recorded, that would be a matter for a human agent to investigate, since it's outside what I can resolve through my available actions. Would you like me to transfer you to a human agent to look into the potential record discrepancy?\nassistant: I understand you're frustrated, and I hear that you believe you selected insurance at the time of booking. However, I need to be direct and clear: I am not able to add travel insurance to your reservation after the booking has been made. This is a firm policy rule, not a technicality I can work around, and I do not have any tool or authorization to modify insurance details post-bo", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T19:53:16"}
