{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to adjust a reservation I have. I'm flying from Houston to Seattle on May 23rd and I'd like to move that to May 24th instead. On top of that, I want to upgrade the cabin to business class for everyone on the booking.\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521. I don't have my reservation ID on hand right now, but maybe you can locate it with that user ID?\nWait, I see you've noted that the cabin has to be uniform across all flights, meaning the return would also need to be business class. S", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you modify your reservation. Before I can proceed, I need to collect some information.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Also, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1849235\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"F