{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to modify my flight booking. I'd like to change my outgoing flight to a nonstop flight departing the next day, and also move my return from SFO back by one day. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is yara_garcia_1905 and the reservation ID is HXDUBJ.\nThanks. I do have some time restrictions though \u2014 I only want flights departing after 8am and before 9pm. So the 7am outgoing (HAT180) is too early for me, and the 11pm return (HAT082) is too late. I\u2019d like to go with **HAT072** f", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID**?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, just let me know your user ID and I can help locate it for you.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {