{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#1", "task_desc": "Bonjour\u2014I mean, hello. I am Amelia Davis. I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I am French, so my English is not perfect, but I need to do this.\nAh, yes. My user ID is amelia_davis_8890. \n\nFor the reason... I want to cancel so I can give up my seat for someone else who needs it more, vous comprenez? But I do not know the reservation IDs, I am sorry. Can you find them with my user ID?\nAh, but monsieur, I think there is a misunderstanding. I want to cancel **all** of", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo proceed, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"amelia_davis_123\"). Could you please provide that? \n\nAlso, for each reservation you'd like to cancel, I'll need to know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons). If you don't know your reservation IDs, I can help locate them once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_car