{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#0", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious right now! I need to speak with someone about a flight I had booked with you earlier this month for a business trip. The flight got canceled without any proper warning, and because of that I ended up missing a critically important meeting with a client. This whole mess caused me a huge amount of stress and honestly some real professional damage. I expect to be compensated for this inconvenience and the meeting I lost!\nLook, I already told you I'm upset about this! My user", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. I'd like to help you with this. To look into the details and confirm what happened, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide me with:\n1. Your user ID\n2. Your reservation ID (if you don't have it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nOnce I have these, I can review the reservation and the flight status to confirm the facts before proceeding.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me look into them to find the canceled business flight from earlier this month.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#0", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious! My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle has been delayed and nobody has given me a straight answer about why. I need to know what caused this, and I expect the airline to make it right with some kind of compensation for the hassle.\nMy user ID is ethan_martin_2396. I don't have the exact flight date handy right now, but it was the HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle that got delayed.\n\nHold on \u2014 you're telling me you can only offer compensation if I cancel or change my flight?", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay and the frustration it's caused. I'd like to help look into this and confirm the details of your reservation.\n\nTo proceed, I'll need a few pieces of information:\n- Your **user ID** (e.g., `sara_doe_496`)\n- Your **reservation ID** (if you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID)\n- The **date** of flight HAT039 you were scheduled to take\n\nI can check the flight status to confirm the delay through my system. However, please note that the specific *cause* of a delay is not information available through my tools \u2014 if you need that detail, I may need to transfer you to a human agent who can investigate further.\n\nRegarding compensation: per our policy, a certificate can be offered for a delayed flight only if you'd like to **change or cancel** the affected reservation, and after the facts are confirmed and the change/cancellation is processed. If that's something you'd like to do, let me know and I can help with that once I've pulled up your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and the flight date so I can begin?\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'll address both of your points clearly.\n\n**Regarding compensation:** I'm unable to offer compensation in this case. Per our policy, a certificate for a delayed flight can only be provided if you wish to **change or cancel** the affected reservation, and only after that change or cancellation is processed (at $50 per passenger). Since you've explicitly stated you do not want to change or cancel your reservation, I must deny the request for a travel voucher or refund for the delay, as it falls outside of what our policy permits.\n\n**Regarding the cause of the delay:** As I mentioned, the specific reason for a delay is not information available through my tools, and this is something I cannot resolve on my own. Since you've asked to be transferred to someone who can investigate and explain what happen", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to my upcoming trip from Atlanta to Philadelphia. I\u2019d like to shift it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest available Economy fare\u2014but not Basic Economy.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me right now\u2014would you be able to look that up using my user ID?\nThat works perfectly for me. I\u2019m happy to go with that routing, and I\u2019m fine with the refund of the difference going back to the ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your user profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT015\", \"origin\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Ivan Muller \u2014 my user ID is ivan_muller_7015. I\u2019d like to book a flight for my friend Ivan Smith. He\u2019s in my profile, though I can\u2019t remember his date of birth offhand, but it should be on file. The trip needs to match the reservation I already have exactly. Also, I\u2019m planning to apply my travel certificate to this booking and I\u2019d like to know what certificate balance would remain afterward.\nThanks for laying that out. A couple of corrections and confirmations from my side:\n\n- **I", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with that. Let me first look up your profile to find your existing reservation details, Ivan Smith's information, and your travel certificate.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. I can see Ivan Smith (DOB 1986-03-14) is saved as a passenger, and you have a travel certificate (certificate_8998287) with a balance of $500. You also have an existing reservation G72NSF. Let me pull up that reservation so we can match the trip exactly.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"G72NSF\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 158}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT251\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 141}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1952-01-28\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 658}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T19:32:36\", \"total_baggages\": 2, \"nonfree_baggages\"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "I... I don't even know where to start. Something horrible happened. My wife... she passed away just yesterday. I have a flight booked and I... I can't go on the original date. I need to move it, just push it back a couple of days. I don't want to cancel it, I just... I need to change the date. Please, you have to help me.\nThank you... I appreciate that. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. And the reservation I need to change is EUJUY6. I... I just need to move it out two days from the original date.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. I'll help you modify your reservation to a later date.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. If you also have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well \u2014 if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: I understand. Let me pull up your reservation and profile details so I can help you move the flights.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}],