{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#0", "task_desc": "Hello, my name is Raj Sanchez. I actually called your support line not too long ago and was told that a service agent would be able to help me cancel a reservation I have. I\u2019d like to go ahead and get that trip cancelled.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID in front of me right now, but hopefully you can pull up my bookings with that.\nI\u2019d like to cancel the Philadelphia to LaGuardia trip \u2014 that\u2019s the round-trip booking **Q69X3R** with just me, Raj Sanchez, on it", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"raj_sanchez_123\"). Could you please provide that? \n\nAlso, if you happen to know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passenge