{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Raj Brown. I'm calling because I need to change my upcoming roundtrip flights \u2014 I have a health issue that's making travel difficult, but I did purchase insurance for this trip, so I'd like any change fees waived. My reservation is VA5SGQ, currently DTW to LGA and back. I'd like to change that to nonstop flights from DTW to JFK and back, keeping the same travel dates as my current booking. Can you help me with that?\nThanks for explaining. Since I can't just modify the destination,", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with that. Let me first look up your reservation details to find your user ID and current flight information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you for providing the details. I've located your reservation VA5SGQ (user ID: raj_brown_5782), which is a round-trip economy booking from DTW to LGA with a connection in PHX,