{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I have to say I'm really furious right now. My flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle got delayed, and because of that I'm going to miss a really important meeting I had planned. This is a big deal for me and I'm not happy about it at all.\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. I don't have my reservation ID in front of me at the moment, and I'm not totally sure of the exact flight date without checking \u2014 but I'm sure you can look up the booking with my ID.\n", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay and the impact on your important meeting. I'd like to help you with this. To confirm the details and assist you with changing or cancelling your reservation, I'll need a few pieces of information:\n\n1. Your user ID (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your reservation ID (e.g., `ZFA04Y`) \u2014 if you don't have it, I can help locate it using your user ID\n3. The date of flight HAT045 (so I can confirm the delay)\n\nCould you please provide these?\nassistant: Thank you for clarifying. Let me look up your profile and reservation details to confirm the facts.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"166