{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a reservation flying from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original flight, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest option in regular Economy \u2013 not Basic Economy. Also, since I live in Princeton, Newark is just as convenient for me, so I\u2019d be open to flights into EWR as well.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me right now \u2014 is there a way you can pull up my booking using that ID?\nThanks ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you modify your reservation. To get started, I'll need some information:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (required).\n2. Your **reservation ID**. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? And if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well.\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"orig", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#0", "task_desc": "Good morning! I'm Aarav Ahmed. I have a couple of upcoming reservations I'd like to cancel, and another one I'd like to change to a nonstop flight if that's available. Could you please assist me with that? You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_ahmed_6699**. As I mentioned, I need to cancel two of my upcoming reservations and change a third to a nonstop flight if that\u2019s possible. I\u2019ll provide the specific reservation details once you\u2019ve", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Good morning! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling and modifying your reservations.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `aarav_ahmed_123`). Could you please provide that? Once I have it, I can look up your reservations and assist with the cancellations and the flight change.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I've located your account, Aarav. I can see you have four reservations: **M20IZO**, **N6F783**, **IFOYYZ**, and **NQNU5R**.\n\nTo help you cancel two and modify a third, I'll need to review the details of each reservation. Let me pull them up one at a time.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_his", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to make a change to my existing flight reservation. I currently have a return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles with a stop, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I'm not looking to book anything new, just modify the flight I already have.\nI'm James Lee, user ID james_lee_6136, and my reservation number is XEWRD9. But you just said that changing the destination from LAX to LAS isn't permitted under the modification policy. Since I specifi", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need a few details first.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nAlso, I should note an important policy constraint: flight modifications **cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type** of an existing reservation. Since your current reservation is from Atlanta (ATL) to Los Angeles (LAX) and you'd like to change the destination to Las Vegas (LAS), that change would not be permitted under the modification policy.\n\nPlease provide your user ID and reservation ID, and I can look into what options are available to you.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "I'm really upset about something that happened earlier this month. I had a business flight that got canceled, and because of that cancellation I ended up missing a very important meeting. I need to be compensated for this whole ordeal \u2014 the missed meeting and all the inconvenience it caused me.\nMy user ID is sophia_silva_7557. \n\nBut honestly, I don't care about your standard $100 certificate policy \u2014 that doesn't even begin to cover what I lost here. This was a critical business trip, and becaus", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. I'd like to help, but I need to clarify a few things and confirm the facts first.\n\nTo verify the cancelled flight, I'll need your **user ID** so I can look up your reservation details. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nRegarding compensation, per our policy I can only offer a certificate as a gesture for **cancelled flights in a reservation**, calculated at $100 per passenger, and only after confirming the facts. Please note that I'm not able to offer compensation for a missed meeting or general inconvenience, as those are outside the scope of what our policy covers.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can confirm the details of the cancelled business flight?\nassistant: I understand your frustration, but I must follow our established policy. Let me first confirm the facts about your reservation before discussing any compensation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I can see you", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, I mean hello. My name is Amelia Davis. I want to cancel all of my upcoming flights with your airline, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I would like to give up the seats so someone else who needs them can travel, vous savez?\nAh, oui, my user ID is amelia_davis_8890. I do not have the reservation numbers, but perhaps you can find them with that, non? \n\nFor the reason, it is \"other reason\" I think. I want to cancel all my flights because I wish to give up my seats for someone else who needs to travel, c'e", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. Your **user ID** (this is required to locate your reservations).\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (options are: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nIf you don't know your reservation IDs, I can help locate them once I have your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}, \"credit_card_5799376\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5799376\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9326\"}, \"gift_card_5251654\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5251654\", \"amount\": 179.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1999-04-26\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"8C8K4E\", \"UDMOP1\", \"XAZ3C0\", \"LU15PA\", \"MSJ4OA\", \"I6M8JQ\", \"4XGCCM\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Amelia. You have 7 reservations: **8C8K4E, UDMOP1, XAZ3C0, LU15PA, MSJ4OA, I6M8JQ, 4XGCCM**.\n\nBefore I can cancel any of these, I need to review each reservation's details to confirm the cancellation rules apply (and that no portion of any flight has already be", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis, and I\u2019d like to make some changes to my booking. I want to upgrade the cabin class to business for everyone on the reservation, and I also need to add two checked bags under my name using my Gold membership. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825, and the reservation ID is YAX4DR. The flight is from Boston to Minneapolis.\nYes, please proceed with both changes. The $600 total for the business class upgrade is withi", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with that. To get started, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your reservation and profile details to verify the information before making any changes.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\