{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I was on the phone with a customer support rep not long ago, and they mentioned that a service agent like yourself would be able to help me cancel my reservation. I need to cancel an upcoming trip of mine.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340.\nI'd like to cancel the Philadelphia to LaGuardia trip \u2014 that's the one with reservation ID Q69X3R. The reason is just a change of plan on my end.\nWait, that doesn't sound right. The customer support representative I spoke with on the phone specifica", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like 'sara_doe_496'). \n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! I found your profile. You have several reservations: **MZDDS4, 60RX9E, S5IK51, OUEA45, Q69X3R**. \n\nLet me look up the details of these reservations to help identify your upcoming trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"MZDDS4\", \"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT050\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 1305}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT228\", \"origin\": \"LAX\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 1126}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1746}], \"pa", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm looking at my upcoming trip details online and I'm certain I purchased travel insurance when I booked my flight, but it's nowhere to be found in my reservation. I'm traveling with my family and everyone else on the booking already has their insurance confirmed, so I really need to get this sorted out on my end.\nSure, my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0.\n\nBut I want to clarify \u2014 I'm not trying to add insurance after the fact. I'm positive I selected th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern about the travel insurance. However, I need to inform you that per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made\u2014this applies to all passengers on a reservation.\n\nTo verify the current state of your reservation and confirm the insurance details, I'll need some information from you first:\n- Your user ID\n- Your reservation ID\n\nIf you don't have your reservation ID handy, I can help locate it once you provide your user ID.\n\nPlease provide these details so I can look into this for you.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation and user details to verify the current state.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-