{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a booking for a quick half-day trip to Texas, but I can't seem to find my reservation number. My return flight is currently set for 3pm on the 28th, and I\u2019d like to change it to a later flight back to Newark that same day\u2014or if nothing\u2019s available later, then the earliest flight the next morning. Can you help me sort that out?\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you modify your return flight. To locate your reservation, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (Z7GOZK, K67C4W, THY2DG). Let me look at the details of each to find the one matching your Texas trip with a return flight on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT188\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 52}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT207\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 87}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 169}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-13T19:41:32\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K67C4W\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I need to adjust my travel plans. For my booking, I want to take a later outgoing flight \u2014 specifically, I'd like to fly out the day after my original date, and I want it to be a direct, nonstop flight. Also, I need to push my return trip from SFO one day later as well.\nSure, my user ID is yara_garcia_1905. And the reservation I'm referring to is HXDUBJ.\nThanks for the options. I have a specific time window I need to stick to \u2014 I only want flights departing after 8am and ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"377 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 694\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80212\"}, \"email\": \"yara.garcia6882@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_2345996\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2345996\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_6941833\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 152.0}, \"gift_card_1646646\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1646646\", \"amount\": 200.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\", \"dob\": \"1959-08-18\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"HXDUBJ\", \"DXG8T6\", \"46BBSE\", \"P9VXUO\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I've retrieved your reservation details. Let me review your current booking:\n\n**Reservation HXDUBJ** (Round trip, Economy cabin)\n- **Outgoing (2024-05-18):** ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia Kim. I need to take a passenger off one of my bookings \u2013 his name is Ethan. I also want to look into booking a flight from New York out to the West Coast. Can you help me with both of those?\nOkay, since you can't remove Ethan from the reservation, then please go ahead and cancel my booking H9ZU1C \u2014 I'll just rebook myself later.\n\nNow for the new trip: my user ID is mia_kim_4397. I'm looking for a round-trip flight from New York \u2014 either Newark (EWR) or JFK \u2014 to anywhere on the West C", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mia! I can help with your requests, but I need to clarify a few things:\n\n**Regarding removing Ethan from a booking:**\nI'm sorry, but per our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to both agents and human agents. I'm unable to remove Ethan from your existing booking. If you'd like, I can help you look up your reservation details, or you may want to consider other options like canceling and rebooking (subject to cancellation rules).\n\n**Regarding booking a new flight from New York to the West Coast:**\nI'd be happy to help with this! To get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., the format like `mia_kim_123`).\n2. **Trip type** \u2014 is this a one-way or round-trip flight?\n3. **Specific airports** \u2014 New York has JFK, LGA, and EWR. For the West Coast, which city/airport are you flying to (e.g., LAX, SFO, SEA)?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can also pull up your profile to confirm your available payment methods and membership level for the booking.\n\nPlease let me know how you'd like to proceed!\nassistant: I'll help you with both. Let me first look up the details of your reservation H9ZU1C to verify the cancellation eligibility before proceeding.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1991-11-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1968-08-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_7359776\", \"amount\": 897}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T04:50:18\", \"total_baggages\": 0, ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 19, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "21#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change the return flight for my Houston to Denver trip. Our departure is May 27, and I want to switch the return to the fastest possible option that same day. This is urgent, so I'd like to get it sorted out as soon as possible.\nSure, my user ID is sofia_kim_7287. I'm sorry, but I don't remember my reservation ID.\nYes, please go ahead and make that change. For the payment, I want you to use my gift card with the smallest balance \u2014 that should be the one with $6 on it, gift_card_748", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you don't know your **reservation ID**, I can help look it up once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sofia_kim_7287\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sofia\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"825 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 595\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77243\"}, \"email\": \"sofia.kim1937@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1950-06-24\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8544743\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8544743\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_9879898\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9879898\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9725\"}, \"gift_card_7091239\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7091239\", \"amount\": 157.0}, \"gift_card_6276644\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6276644\", \"amount\": 113.0}, \"gift_card_7480005\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7480005\", \"amount\": 6.0}, \"certificate_9932251\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9932251\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"l