{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I really need some help with my flight. I have a trip booked out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is really sick and I need to get back home sooner to take care of him. I was hoping I could change my booking to a nonstop flight instead\u2014something that gets me home earlier.\nOf course, I'm Daiki Lee. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm not sure what my reservation ID is, but hopefully you can pull it up with that.\nYes, please transfer me to a human agent. I really need to get back home to take care o", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you look into changing your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can locate your reservation. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: **DF89BM**, **COVE6R**, and **IIHXDG**. Let me check the details to find the one departing from JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0,", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I'd like to shift it to the following day and get the lowest fare in regular Economy, not Basic. By the way, I'm based in Princeton, so Newark is just as convenient for me as Philadelphia\u2014could we look at options for both airports?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don't have my reservation ID handy right now, but hopefully you can locate the booking with that.\nThanks for laying that out. I get that the poli", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you change your flight. Before I can look into your reservation, I'll need some information from you.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you have it \u2014 if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID)\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can pull up your reservation and then explore the options for shifting your Atlanta \u2192 Philadelphia/Newark trip to the following day in Economy class.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Aarav. You hav