{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#1", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Ivan Muller. I\u2019d like to book a flight for my friend Ivan Smith \u2014 it needs to be exactly the same as the reservation I already have with your airline. Can you help me set that up?\nSure, my user ID is ivan_muller_7015. Once you pull up my profile, you should see my current reservation and also my friend Ivan Smith listed there since he\u2019s in my profile.\nThanks for laying that out. Here are my answers:\n\n1. **Passenger count:** Yes, it should be **just Ivan Smith** \u2014 only him as the p", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Ivan! To help you book a flight that matches your existing reservation, I'll first need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! I can see your profile and your existing reservation (G72NSF). Let me pull up the details of that reservation so I can replicate it for Ivan Smith.\ntool: {\"reserv