{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my flights from MCO to CLT and I want a refund for them.\nMy user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. I don't have my reservation ID handy at the moment \u2014 is there a way you can look it up with that? \n\nAs for the reason, my plans have changed and I need to cancel. I want to make sure I get my refund \u2014 that's really important to me.\nI understand what you're saying about the policy, but I'm going to have to insist here. I am Amelia Sanchez, user amelia_sanchez_4739, and I booked reserva", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flights from MCO to CLT, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you know it; if not, I can help locate it)\n3. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)\n\nOnce I have these details, I'll look up your reservation and verify the cancellation eligibility.\nassistant: Let me look up your account to find your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your account. You have two reservations: **3FRNFB** and **Q4L9HS**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from MCO to CLT.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 79}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 64}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"amount\": 286}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-06T13:25:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:20:39"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Ugh, honestly I'm pretty frustrated right now. I've run into some money troubles and I can't keep paying for business class. I need to downgrade all of my business flights to economy \u2014 but I don't want to change any of the flights themselves or the passenger info, just the cabin class. Can you help me sort this out?\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. Look, I know I gotta cooperate here, but this whole thing is stressing me out \u2014 I just need to get these downgrades done without messing up", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your situation. I can help you downgrade the cabin class from business to economy while keeping the same flights and passenger information.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `sara_doe_496`). Once I have that, I can locate your reservations and identify which ones have business class flights.\nassistant: I understand, and I'll make sure we handle this carefully. Let me pull up your profile and reservations now.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amou