{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "37#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need some help with my bookings. I have a few upcoming flights and I'd like to cancel two of them and upgrade another one to business class. Can you assist me with making those changes?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. Once you pull up my account, I'd like to cancel two reservations and upgrade a third one.\nOh, I see \u2014 I must have mixed up the dates on NQNU5R. Since it already flew and your policy doesn't allow cancelling it, I'm totally fine with complying and just leaving that one a", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with cancelling and upgrading your reservations. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can look up your bookings. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your account. I can see you have 4 reservations: **M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R**. \n\nLet me get the details of each so I can hel