{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "14#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to check the total balances on my gift cards and travel certificates with your airline. Could you help me look that up?\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nThank you, so I have $327 total in gift cards and $1,000 total in certificates. \n\nNow I'd like to change my upcoming reservation. I want to keep the same travel dates, but change it to the cheapest business class round trip available \u2014 it can be direct or have connections, whichever is cheapest. Can you help me with that?\n", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To look up your gift card and travel certificate balances, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}