{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "38#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm pretty frustrated right now. I had a flight recently that got delayed and it really messed up my plans. I want to complain about my most recent booking.\nYes, sure. My name is Noah Muller and my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nYes, that reservation 4OG6T3 is the one I'm talking about \u2014 I didn't actually remember the ID, but that's the trip with the delay from Boston to Las Vegas that ruined my plans.\n\nBut hold on, you said 1 passenger? That's definitely wrong. There are **3** of us on that r", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear your flight was delayed. To help you with your complaint, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? This will allow me to look up your most recent booking and the details of the delay.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"cre