{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm really stressed about my upcoming trip. I have so many things I need to bring with me, and it's really important that I get the exact baggage allowance right for my flight. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, so I think that gives me some extra suitcases. Can you help me figure out the total number of suitcases my reservation allows?\nYes, of course. My user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm really anxious about this because I have a lot to pack and I need to be sure of the exact suitcase count.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you figure out your baggage allowance. To look up your reservation and membership details, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your profile. I notice that your membership level is actually **silver** (not gold as you mentioned), so the baggage allowance will be based on silver member benefits.\n\nYou have several reservations on file: 82K959, 790JYN, BE2L57, CXBB4L, TAMSDK, 3RK2T9, VAOW1B, Q4MCUF, JMO1MG.\n\nCould you please tell me which reservation you'd like me to check the baggage allowance for? If you don't have the reservation ID handy, let me know which trip (origin, destination, and date) you're referring to and I can help locate it.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel my flight reservation. The confirmation number is EHGLP3.\nMy user ID is emma_kim_9957. As for the reason, I was out of town right after I booked the trip, so I couldn't take care of it sooner, but now I need to cancel the reservation EHGLP3.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To proceed with the cancellation, I need a few more details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496').\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide these?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Emma\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"109 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 171\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19151\"}, \"email\": \"emma.kim3947@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1977-09-23\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5832574\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5241\"}, \"gift_card_9562694\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9562694\", \"amount\": 103.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mason\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1952-04-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1983-05-15\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"EHGLP3\", \"66EEUA\", \"MDCLVA\", \"H1QGCY\"]}\nassistant: Let me check the status of the flights in your reservation to determine eligibility for cancellation.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've re", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles that currently has a stop, and I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I just want to modify my existing reservation, not book a brand new ticket.\nSince you're saying this change can't be done as a modification to my existing reservation, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can help me with switching my flight to Las Vegas. Could you please transfer me to the appropriate agent?\n###TRANSFER", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to fulfill this request as described.\n\nAccording to our flight modification policy, reservations can only be modified **without changing the origin, destination, and trip type**. Since you'd like to change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), this cannot be done as a modification to your existing reservation.\n\nAdditionally, modifications cannot change the trip type (e.g., from a connecting/one-stop itinerary to a nonstop), and the origin and destination must remain exactly the same.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with modifications that keep the same Atlanta (ATL) \u2192 Los Angeles (LAX) route, such as changing flight times, dates, or cabin class (for non-basic-economy fares). Alternatively, if you'd prefer to cancel and rebook a new ticket to Las Vegas, please note that is a separate process from modifying.\n\nPlease let me know how you'd like to proceed, and if you'd like me to look into any of the allowed modifications, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "19#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a reservation for a short half-day trip to Texas, but I don\u2019t have my reservation ID with me. I need to change my return flight \u2014 right now it\u2019s scheduled to leave at 3pm on the 28th heading back to Newark. I\u2019d like to take a later flight that same day if possible, or if there\u2019s nothing later, then the earliest flight the next day.\nSure, my user ID is olivia_gonzalez_2305.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"334 Laurel Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 970\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90504\"}, \"email\": \"olivia.gonzalez4421@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2200803\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2200803\", \"amount\": 123.0}, \"credit_card_9969263\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9969263\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9475\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1981-09-25\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"Z7GOZK\", \"K67C4W\", \"THY2DG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile with three reservations. Let me check the details of each to find the one matching your Texas trip with a return flight to Newark on the 28th.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Z7GOZK\", \"user_id\": \"olivia_gonzalez_2305\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"fl