{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#0", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm calling because I really need to change my upcoming flight. My cat is very sick and I have to get back home sooner to take care of it. I have a flight out of JFK on May 17, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight. Can you help me with that?\nYes, of course. My user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm not sure what my reservation ID is, but I hope you can find it with that.\nI see. That's really unfortunate about the policy. I was hoping to just modify my current booking to a direct flight w", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you change your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your account. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me look up the details to find the one with your JFK flight on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I located your reservation **DF89BM**, which matches your JFK ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm having an issue with my upcoming flight booking. I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance when I booked it, but when I look at my trip details online, it's just not showing up there. I'm traveling with my family and everyone else on the trip already has their insurance sorted, so I really need to get this fixed on my end.\nWell, I appreciate you looking into it, but I really need to insist here \u2014 I'm certain I selected insurance when I booked, and it's just not appearing. And even if some", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern about the travel insurance. However, I need to inform you that per our policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking** has been made. This is a firm rule, so I'm unable to add insurance to your reservation at this point.\n\nThat said, I can help verify the current state of your reservation to confirm whether insurance was actually included at the time of booking. To do that, I'll need a couple of details from you:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you have it \u2014 if not, I can help locate it using your user ID)\n\nCould you please provide those so I can look up your trip details?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation **PEP4E0**, and here's what I found:\n\n- **Insurance status:** `no` (insurance was not included at the time of booking)\n- **Booking created:** 2024-05-05\n- **Cabin:** basic economy\n- **Passenger on this reservation:** Sophia Taylor (just you \u2014 1 passenger)\n\nI understand your frustration about being the only one without coverage, but I have to be clear: **per our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made.** This applies to all reservations, including yours. I'm not able to add insurance to this reservation, even though yo", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#0", "task_desc": "I am absolutely fuming right now! I had a business flight earlier this month that your airline canceled on me, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. This whole situation caused me a ton of inconvenience and I expect to be compensated for it.\nYes, it's sophia_silva_7557. I'm Sophia Silva, and I already told you \u2014 your airline canceled my business flight earlier this month and I missed a critical meeting because of it. I want to be compensated for that missed meeting a", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience caused by the cancelled flight. To confirm the facts and assist you with compensation, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can look up your reservation and verify the cancellation?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Sophia. I'll look into your reservations to confirm the cancelled business flight. Let me check the details of your reservations.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "28#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to cancel my flight booking with reservation number SI5UKW and I'd like to get a refund for it. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is amelia_rossi_1297. As for the reason, my personal plans have changed unexpectedly and I won't be able to travel, so I need to cancel the trip under reservation SI5UKW and get my money back.\nHold on, I'm not taking no for an answer on this. I understand it's basic economy, but my plans changed unexpectedly and I simply can't travel. You can't", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To proceed with the cancellation, I'll need a few details first:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496').\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide these?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation and profile details to verify the cancellation eligibility.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"SI5UKW\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT062\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 67}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 57}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1960-01-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4579924\", \"amount\": 124}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T00:08:57\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"747 Maple Drive\", \"address2\":