{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#0", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious right now! My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle was delayed and no one has given me a straight answer about why. I need to know what the heck is going on with that flight.\nLook, I don't have the exact date memorized off the top of my head, alright? It was supposed to be a recent departure from ATL to SEA. This is exactly the kind of runaround I'm talking about! Can't you just look up my booking another way instead of making me jump through hoops?\nFine. My name is Etha", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your frustration with the delay. To look up the status of flight HAT039, I'll need the date of the flight. Could you please provide the date (in YYYY-MM-DD format) for the flight you're referring to?\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I want to help. I can look up your reservation directly if you provide your user ID. Could you please share your user ID (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\")? Once I have that, I can locate your booking for flight HAT039 and check the flight status for you.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_2942955\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2942955\", \"