{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "This is absolutely unacceptable! I had a business flight booked earlier this month that got canceled without any warning, and because of that I ended up missing a critically important meeting. I expect to be compensated for the inconvenience and the damages from that missed meeting \u2014 I'm not just going to let this slide!\nMy user ID is sophia_silva_7557. But honestly, a $100 travel certificate is a joke for what I went through! I'm Sophia Silva, and that cancellation directly caused me to miss a ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. To look into this and confirm the details of your canceled flight, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Once I have that, I can locate your reservation and verify the facts regarding the cancellation.\n\nPlease note that per our policy, compensation for canceled flights is offered as a travel certificate gesture of $100 per passenger after the facts are confirmed. We are not able to provide compensation for damages such as a missed meeting, as that falls outside the scope of what I can offer.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, but I must follow our policy, which only allows a travel certificate gesture for canceled flights \u2014 I'm not able to process compensation for damages such as a missed meeting. Let me first confirm the facts of your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_804538