{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a reservation for a flight from Boston to Minneapolis\u2014the confirmation code is YAX4DR. I\u2019d like to change the class for all passengers on that booking to business.\nOh, $1,200 is quite a bit more than I was prepared to pay\u2014my limit for the upgrade is $650 max. So I don\u2019t want to do both passengers. Instead, could you just upgrade my companion Noah Hernandez to business class? That would be $600 total for him, which fits my budget.\n\nAlso, separately from the upgrade, I need to add 2 che", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you change the cabin class to business. First, let me look up the reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I have the reservation details. The reservation YAX4DR belongs to user **chen_lee_6825**, currently in **economy** class, with 2 passengers (Chen Lee and Noah Hernandez), and two flight segments:\n- HAT235: BOS \u2192 MCO on 2024-05-18\n- HAT298: MCO \u2192 MSP on 2024-05-19\n\nBefore changing the cabin, I need to verify that no flight in this reservation