{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "16#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a reservation to fly from Atlanta to Philadelphia, and I need to change it to the day after my original travel date. I\u2019m looking for the cheapest flight available in regular Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can look up my booking with that. I\u2019m the one flying from ATL to PHL.\nYes, that works perfectly for me. Please go ahead and book the cheapest regular economy option with the connection", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you modify your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need a couple of details:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y')\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, just let me know your user ID and I can help locate it for you.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from ATL to PHL.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\"