{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Ugh, look, I'm dealing with some money troubles right now and I need to downgrade all my business class flights to economy. I can't afford this anymore. I don't want to change any of the flights or the passengers, just the cabin class. Can you help me with that?\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. I'm Omar Davis, by the way. I just need to get these downgrades done as quickly as possible because I'm really stressed about money right now.\nUgh, finally. Yes, just go ahead and process all fi", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with changing the cabin class. To get started, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Thank you, Omar. Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"