{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I've got a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I'm looking to move it to the day after my original reservation, and I want the cheapest regular Economy fare\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, just so you know, I live in Princeton, so Newark is just as convenient for me as Philadelphia. Maybe we can look at options to either PHL or EWR?\nOh, I see\u2014I was hoping to compare flights into Newark since I'm based in Princeton and either airport works for me, but if the policy does", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you change your flight. \n\nBefore I proceed, I need a few details:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. **Your reservation ID** (if you don't have it handy, I can look it up for you once I have your user ID)\n\nOne important note regarding your request: Per airline policy, when modifying flights, the **origin, destination, and trip type cannot be changed**. This means I can change the date of your flight to the day after your original reservation, but I won't be able to change the destination from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR). The destination must remain PHL.\n\nPlease provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it), and I'll help you find the cheapest Economy fare for the day after your original booking.\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav! Let me look up your reservation details using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id