{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I really need to change my upcoming flight. I have a flight out of JFK on May 17, but my cat is really sick and I need to get back home sooner to take care of it. I was hoping to change to a nonstop flight that gets me there earlier. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I'm sorry but I don't have my reservation ID handy \u2014 I don't know what it is. Can you look it up for me with my user ID?\nOh, that's really unfortunate. I was counting on being able to change to a ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your cat. I'd be happy to help you change your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations: DF89BM, COVE6R, and IIHXDG. Let me look up the details of each to find the one with a flight out of JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "14#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mohamed Silva. I'd like to check the total balances on my gift cards and travel certificates attached to my account. Could you help me find out how much I have in each?\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nThanks for the summary. So I have $327 total in gift cards and $1,000 total in certificates.\n\nNow, I'd like to change my upcoming reservation. I want to keep the same travel dates, but switch it to the cheapest business class round trip \u2014 direct or connecting is fine either way. ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mohamed! I'd be happy to help you check the balances on your gift cards and travel certificates. To look up your account details, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"mohamed_silva_123\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four