{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'd like to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nMy user ID is mia_li_3668. Either JFK or LGA is fine with me.\nBoth of those flights depart before 11am EST, and I don't want to fly that early. Do you have any flights from JFK to Seattle on May 20th that leave after 11am?\nI'll go with Option 2 in Economy class \u2014 that's the lower-priced economy option.\n\nIt'll just be me, Mia Li. My date of birth is already in my user profile, so I'd prefer not to provide it again.\n\nAn", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\n\nAlso, just to confirm the airport codes:\n- New York: JFK (John F. Kennedy) or LGA (LaGuardia)\n- Seattle: SEA\n\nPlease let me know which New York airport you'd prefer to depart from, and provide your user ID so I can look up your profile and available payment methods.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia. I can see you're a **gold member** with the following payment methods on file:\n- Credit card (Visa) ending in 7447\n- Credit card (Visa) ending in 1907\n- Travel certificate (amount $100)\n- Travel certificate (amount $250)\n\nNow let me search for available flights from New York to Seattle on May 20th. Let me start with JFK.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT069\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"status\": \"available\", \"scheduled_departure_time_est\": \"06:00:00\", \"scheduled_arrival_time_est\": \"12:00:00\", \"date\": null, \"available_seats\": {\"basic_economy\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T20:44:46"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Ethan Martin and I am extremely upset right now. My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle has been delayed and I want to know exactly why this happened. This is completely unacceptable!\nLook, I don't have the exact date memorized right now, but my name is Ethan Martin and my user ID is ethan_martin_2396. The flight is HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle. \n\nI am absolutely furious about this delay! I demand to know why this flight was held up \u2014 what was the reason? And beyond that, I expect", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your frustration with the delay. I can check the status of flight HAT039 for you, but I'll need the date of the flight to look it up. Could you please provide the date (in YYYY-MM-DD format) for your flight from Atlanta (ATL) to Seattle (SEA)?\n\nPlease also note that I can confirm the flight status through our system, but I'm unable to provide the specific reason for the delay, as that information is not available to me through our tools.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'll help you look into this. Let me first pull up your profile and reservation details to confirm the facts.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}