{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "34#1", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Yara Garcia. I have a booking with reference HXDUBJ. I need to adjust my travel plans: I\u2019d like to switch my outgoing flight to a nonstop one departing a day later than originally scheduled. Also, for my return from SFO, I want to push it back by a day, change the ticket to business class, and add two checked bags. I\u2019m hoping to get all of these modifications done together as a single package.\nThanks for laying that out. Based on my preferences, I need flights departing after 8am ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with these modifications. First, let me look up your reservation details to understand the current booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you. I've found your reservation. Let me gather more information to help with your modifications \u2014 I'll look up your user profile and search for the new flight options.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address