{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Raj Brown. I've got a health condition that's making it hard for me to travel as planned, and fortunately I bought trip insurance for my booking. I need to change my flights and I'd like the change fees waived because of that coverage. Right now I have a roundtrip reservation from DTW to LGA and back, and I want to switch to nonstop flights from DTW to JFK and back on the same dates as my current trip. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is raj_brown_5782, and the reservation ID ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. First, I'll need a few details to locate your booking.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID** (for example, something like `raj_brown_123`)? \n\nAlso, if you don't have your **reservation ID** handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOne note for now: per our modification policy, flight changes must keep the same **origin, destination, and trip type**. Changing your destination from LGA to JFK would not be permitted as a flight modification. I'll confirm the details of your current reservation once I have your user ID, and we can discuss the best path forward.\nassistant: Thank you. Let me pull up your profile and reservation details to review your situation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"127 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 411\", \"city\": \"San Jose\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"95153\"}, \"email\": \"raj.brown6519@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7686643\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7686643\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"2273\"}, \"gift_card_6468981\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_