{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I'm dealing with a health problem and I need to adjust my travel plans. I had purchased trip insurance for my booking, so I'm hoping the change fees can be waived. Currently I have a roundtrip reservation from Detroit to LaGuardia, and I'd like to switch it to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back, keeping the same travel dates. Can you help me get that changed?\nSure, my user ID is raj_brown_5782 and the reservation ID is VA5SGQ. \n\nAs I mentioned, I'm dealing with ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. Before I proceed, I'll need some information from you.\n\nFirst, could you please provide your **user ID**? (For example, something like \"sara_doe_496\".)\n\nAlso, do you happen to have your **reservation ID**? If not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOne important note: per our modification policy, flight changes must keep the same **origin, destination, and trip type**. Changing your destination from LaGuardia (LGA) to JFK would be a change of destination, which is not permitted through a modification. I'll confirm the details of your current reservation once I have your user ID, and we can discuss the best path forward.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\