{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "raw_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mohamed Silva. I'd like to find out the total balance on my gift cards and the total on my travel certificates. Also, I need to change my recent reservation to the cheapest business class round trip, keeping the same dates. Can you help with that?\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nThanks for the details. I notice you gave me the gift card total of $327, but I still need to know the **sum of my certificate balances** \u2014 that was part of my original question and hasn't come through ye", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mohamed Silva! To help you with both requests, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"mohamed_silva_123\")?\n\nOnce I have that, I can:\n1. Look up the balances on your gift cards and travel certificates.\n2. Locate your recent reservation and help change it to the cheapest business class round trip with the same dates.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\":