{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to my upcoming return flight. I currently have a one-stop flight from ATL to LAX, but I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from ATL to LAS instead.\nI understand your policy, but I only want to modify my current reservation, not book a new flight. Since you've said this change isn't possible on your end, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can assist with this. My user ID is james_lee_6136 and reservation number XEWRD9, by the way.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to make that change. According to our policy, flight modifications can be made without changing the **origin, destination, and trip type** of the reservation. Since your request would change the destination from LAX to LAS, this is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications that keep the same origin (ATL) and destination (LAX), such as:\n- Changing to a different flight on the same ATL\u2013LAX route (e.g., a nonstop instead of one-stop)\n- Changing the cabin class\n- Adding checked bags\n- Updating passenger details\n\nAlternatively, if you no longer wish to travel to LAX, you would need to cancel the existing reservation (subject to cancellation rules) and book a new one to LAS.\n\nPlease let me know how you'd like to proceed, and I'll need your user ID and reservation ID to assist further.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
