{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT. I really need to get a refund for it.\nMy user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. I don't really have a specific category for the reason \u2014 I just need to cancel that MCO to CLT flight and I really insist on getting my refund for it.\nI hear what you're saying about the policy, but I really need to cancel this MCO to CLT flight and get my refund. I understand the conditions you listed, but I'm insisting on the cancellation and the refund being processed for m", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (For example, something like 'sara_doe_496'.)\n\nAlso, could you let me know the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your profile and reservations to locate the MCO to CLT flight.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations (3FRNFB and Q4L9HS). Let me check the details of both 