{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel my flight reservation. The confirmation code is EHGLP3.\nYes, that's correct \u2014 my user ID is emma_kim_9957. \n\nAs for the reason, my plans have changed. I was out of town for a while after I booked the trip, and now I won't be able to take those flights on May 17th, so I need to cancel the whole reservation.\nHold on, that doesn't sound right to me. When I made this booking, I was told I didn't need to purchase insurance because my previous trip was booked through the same ag", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you cancel your reservation. Let me first look up the reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me check the status of the flights in your reservation.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've located your reservation. The reservation **EHGLP3** is associated with user ID **emma_kim_9957** and contains two one-way basic economy flights (HAT156 PHX\u2192SEA and HAT021 SEA\u2192JFK) on 2024-05-17, booked on 2024-05-04. Both flights are currently available (not yet flown).\n\nBefore I can proceed, I need a couple of details from you:\n\n1. **Please confirm your user ID** (it should be `emma_kim_9957`).\n2. **What is the reason for cancellation?** (Options: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)\n\nOnce I have these, I'll review the cancellation eligibility for your booking.\nassistant: Thank you for confirming. I've reviewed your cancellation request against our policy, and I'm sorry to inform you that I'm unable to process the cancellation of reservation **EHGLP3** at this time.\n\nAccording to the cancellation policy, a reservation can only be cancelled if one of the following conditions is true:\n\n1. **The booking was made within the last 24 hours** \u2014 Your booking was created on 2024-05-04, which is w", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "30#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I need to make some changes to my upcoming trip from Las Vegas to Houston. It's currently a one-stop flight, and I'd like to change it to a nonstop option if possible. Also, I want to remove my checked bag and get a refund for that.\nOkay, I understand about the checked bag \u2014 that's fine, we'll leave that as is and move on. \n\nMy user ID is james_taylor_7043. I'd still like to change that one-stop flight from LAS to IAH to a nonstop if you can find one available.\nThanks for", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with your trip changes. Before I can look up your reservation, I'll need some information.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (For example, something like \"sara_doe_496\".)\n\nAlso, I should let you know that per our policy, **checked bags can be added but not removed** from a reservation, so I won't be able to remove your checked bag or issue a refund for it. However, I can help you look into changing your flight from a one-stop to a nonstop option, provided your reservation is eligible for flight modifications (note: basic economy reservations cannot be modified).\n\nPlease share your user ID so I can locate your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"133 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 494\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77207\"}, \"email\": \"james.taylor4788@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1997-01-23\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9380982\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9380982\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"gift_card_5634230\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5634230\", \"amount\": 67.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\