{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#1", "task_desc": "Hello, um, I'm really stressed about my upcoming trip. I have a ton of stuff I need to bring with me, and it's really important that I know exactly how many suitcases my reservation allows me to take on the flight. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, but I just need to be certain of the allowance. Can you help me figure that out?\nSure, yes. My user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm really anxious about this because I have so much to pack and I need to be sure about the suitcase limit.\nWait, no\u2014I'm pret", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you figure out your baggage allowance. To look up your membership level and reservation details, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've looked up your profile. I should clarify one thing: according to our records, your membership level is **silver**, not gold. This affects your baggage allowance.\n\nI also see you have several reservations on file (82K959, 790JYN, BE2L57, CXBB4L, TAMSDK, 3RK2T9, VAOW1B, Q4MCUF, JMO1MG). \n\nYour baggage allowance depends on the cabin class of the specific reservation and the number of passengers, so could you please tell me which reservation you'd like to know about? If you're not sure of the reservation ID, let me know and I can help locate it.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "Hi... I'm sorry... I'm just... my wife died yesterday and I need to change my flight. I don't want to cancel it, just move the date out a couple of days. I... I can't even think straight right now.\nMy user ID... it's lucas_brown_4047. The reservation is EUJUY6. Please... I just need to move it out two days. My wife... she passed away yesterday and I just can't get on that flight tomorrow like we'd planned. I'm not canceling, I just need a little more time.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss. I'm here to help you as best I can during this difficult time.\n\nTo help you change your flight, I'll need a few details. First, could you please provide your **user ID**? (This is usually something like \"sara_doe_496\".)\n\nIf you also happen to know your **reservation ID**, that would help me locate your booking faster \u2014 but if you don't have it handy, I can look it up for you once I have your user ID.\nassistant: I'm truly sorry. Let me pull up your reservation so I can help you move it.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"amount\": 1008}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-07T19:04:46\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I'm so sorry for your loss, and I truly wish I could make this change for you right now.\n\nI've pulled up your reservation **EUJUY6**. I can see it's a round-trip booking (ORD\u2013LAS) in **basic economy** cabin, with your return flights currently scheduled for **May 16** (LAS\u2192IAH\u2192ORD).\n\nUnfortunately, I have to be straight with you about a limitation: our policy does not allow **flight date changes on basic economy reserv", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need some help with my upcoming flight booking. I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance for myself when I made the reservation, but when I log in and check online, it's not showing up for me. I'm traveling with my family and everyone else already has insurance on their flights, so I really need to get this fixed and have the coverage added to mine as well. Can you look into this for me?\nMy user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0.\n\nBut wait \u2014 I really need to pus", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern. However, I need to inform you that per our airline policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is made**. This is a firm rule, so I'm unable to add insurance coverage to your reservation at this time.\n\nThat said, you mentioned you believe you may have already added insurance when you booked. I can look up your reservation to verify the current insurance status for all passengers. To do that, I'll need:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., `ZFA04Y`) \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it)? I'll then check the details to confirm what's currently on file.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation **PEP4E0**. Here are the facts from the booking:\n\n- **Passenger:** Sophia Taylor (only one passenger on this reservation)\n- **Trip:** One-way, CLT \u2192 PHX, basic economy, on 2024-05-20\n- **Insurance:** Currently set to **\"no\"** \u2014 there is no travel insurance on this reservation\n- **Created:** 2024-05-05\n\nRegarding your request, I'm unable to add travel insurance to this reservation. Our airline policy is explicit: **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial boo", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Ugh, honestly I'm dealing with some sudden financial problems and I'm pretty frustrated about it. I need to downgrade all of my business class flights to economy \u2014 but I don't want to change any of the flight details or the passengers, just the cabin class. Can you help me with that?\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. Look, I know I need to do this, I'm just stressed about the money situation, but let's get it done.\nLook, I'll be honest, this whole thing is stressing me out \u2014 but yeah, I", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your situation. I can help you downgrade the cabin class from business to economy without changing the flights or passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide it?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \