{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I've got a trip coming up from ATL to PHL that I need to reschedule. I want to shift it to the day after my original flight, and I\u2019m hoping to find the lowest fare in regular Economy \u2013 not Basic Economy. Since I live in Princeton, Newark is just as convenient as Philadelphia for me, so I\u2019d be open to looking at EWR arrivals too.\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID on hand right now \u2014 hopefully you can pull up the booking using that user ID.\nThanks for", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you reschedule your trip, I'll need a few details first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, do you have your **reservation ID**? If not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find the one from ATL to PHL.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 2787}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-14T06:33:04\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UHDAHF\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT015\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 98}, {\"flight_num", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "22#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make some changes to my upcoming flight from New York to Chicago. I'd like to change the passenger to myself, upgrade it to economy class, and have 3 checked bags.\nMy user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but you mentioned you could help locate it with the user ID.\nYes, I confirm all three changes. For the $209 upgrade difference, please use my gift card (gift_card_8190333) \u2014 that one has enough balance to cover it.\n###STOP###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6437\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-08-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"UM3OG5\", \"5RJ7UH\", \"FQ8APE\", \"QKRY03\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations: **UM3OG5, 5RJ7UH, FQ8APE, QKRY03**. Let me look up the details to find the one from New York to Chicago.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UM3OG5\", \"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT113\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 117}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT282\", \"origin\": \"DFW\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 140}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT239\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "38#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Noah. I'm pretty frustrated right now because my most recent flight got delayed and it really messed things up for me. I need to sort this out with someone.\nSure, my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nWait, that's not right \u2014 there are 3 passengers on that reservation, not 1! It's me and two others traveling together.\n\nAlso, this delay really messed up our plans, and you're only offering to change or cancel? I think I should get some kind of compensation for the inconvenience \u2014 are you able to", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear your flight was delayed. I'd like to help you with this. To look up your reservation and confirm the details, could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7574394\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1798\"}, \"credit_card_6873705\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6873705\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2267\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1959-11-15\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"SDZQKO\", \"4OG6T3\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Noah. I can see you have two reservations (SDZQKO and 4OG6T3). Let me look at the details to find your most recent flight and confirm the delay.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"SDZQKO\", \"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"origin\": \"LAX\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT228\", \"origin\": \"LAX\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 76}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#0", "task_desc": "Look, I'm pressed for time. I need to remove a passenger named Sophia from my round trip flights from LAS to DEN, departing May 19 and returning May 20. I don't have my reservation ID handy right now. I want the full amount refunded to my original payment method, and I need to know how much that refund will be, quickly.\nUgh, this is a waste of my time. Fine\u2014if you can't take Sophia off the reservation, then just downgrade everyone on the booking to basic economy. I'm in a hurry, so get it done f", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to fulfill this request. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 you may update passenger details (such as name or date of birth), but you cannot add or remove passengers. This restriction applies even to human agents, so I cannot remove Sophia from the reservation or process a refund for her portion.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications that are permitted, such as:\n- Changing flight details (origin, destination, and trip type must stay the same)\n- Changing cabin class\n- Adding checked bags\n- Updating passenger information (without changing the count)\n\nPlease let me know if you'd like to proceed with any of these, and I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation.\nassistant: I'll help you with the cabin downgrade. First, let me locate your reservation using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1973-11-14\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"AAVMM8\", \"MQHHT6\", \"GV1N64\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile with three reservations (AAVMM8, MQHHT6, GV1N64). Let me check each to find the one matching your LAS\u2192DEN round trip (May 19\u201320).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"AAVMM8\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT214\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1358}, {\"fli", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia Kim. I need to remove a passenger from one of my flight reservations. Can you help me with that?\nOh, I see. Well, if you can't remove Ethan from my reservation H9ZU1C, then could you just go ahead and cancel that whole reservation for me? I'll rebook myself later anyway since I'm also looking to plan a new trip.\nSure, my user ID is mia_kim_4397. And the reason for cancelling is just a change of plan \u2014 I'm looking to rebook myself later for a different trip anyway, so it works out.\nOk", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to help with removing a passenger from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers in a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to both agent-assisted changes and even human agent actions. \n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications such as changing passenger details (without changing the number of passengers), changing flights, cabin class, or adding baggage. Please let me know how else I can assist you.\nassistant: I can help you with cancelling the reservation. Before I proceed, I'll need a couple of details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., a format like `mia_kim_123`) \u2014 I have your name as Mia Kim, but I need your account user ID to locate and verify the reservation.\n2. **The reason for cancellation** \u2014 our system requires one of the following: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons.\n\nOnce I have these, I'll look up the reservation details to confirm the cancellation is permitted and proceed accordingly.\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation details to verify the cancellation eligibility.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1991-11-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1968-08-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_7359776\", \"amount\": 897}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T04:50:18\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation H9ZU1C. Based on t", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 16, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to an existing flight reservation. I currently have a return flight from Atlanta to LAX with one stop, and I\u2019d like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I\u2019m not looking to book anything new, just modify the flight I already have.\nI understand, but if changing the destination from LAX to Las Vegas isn't permitted through a flight modification, then I'd like to be transferred to someone who can help me make this change to my existing reser", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you look into modifying your reservation. First, I'll need some information to locate it.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (if you don't know it, I can help find it using your user ID)\n\nAlso, I should note upfront: per our modification policy, a reservation can be modified **without changing the origin, destination, or trip type**. Changing the destination from LAX to Las Vegas would not be permitted through a flight modification. Once I have your details, I can review your reservation and explain the options available to you.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming trip from New York to Chicago, and I\u2019d like to add 3 checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade the booking to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don\u2019t have the reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can locate it with that.\nYes, I'd like to confirm all three changes \u2014 adding the 3 checked bags, changing the passenger to myself, and upgrading to economy. For the $209 difference, I'll use my gift card, the one with the $280 balance (gift_c", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_