{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling about an upcoming flight I have from Boston to Minneapolis. I'd like to change the cabin class for everyone on my booking to business, and I also need to add some checked bags to my reservation. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825.\nGreat, $600 is within what I'm willing to pay, so please go ahead and upgrade both passengers \u2014 myself and Noah \u2014 to business class.\n\nAs for the bags, I'd like to add 2 checked bags under my name, Chen Lee, using my Gold member", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"355 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 365\", \"city\": \"San Francisco\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"94178\"}, \"email\": \"chen.lee7831@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6730850\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6730850\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"certificate_9982533\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9982533\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_4938634\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9990\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"JW6LEQ\", \"ICJ5WM\", \"TVN3KL\", \"ZBCR1P\", \"4KG36I\", \"YAX4DR\", \"9NK7W8\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me locate the one from Boston (BOS) to Minneapolis (MSP). I'll check 