{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#1", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Ivan Rossi. I have a flight booked out of Newark on May 21st, and I need to change it to a nonstop flight that same day. My mother is really sick and I need to get back home sooner to take care of her.\nSure, it's ivan_rossi_8555.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Ivan, I'm sorry to hear about your mother. I'll help you change your flight. \n\nFirst, I'll need your user ID to locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check each one to find the flight departing from Newark (EWR) on May 21st.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"OWZ4XL\", \"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT202\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 94}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT232\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 80}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Santos\", \"dob\": \"1984-06-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Johansson\", \"dob\": \"1995-10-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 522}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-09T13:43:03\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm James Patel. I need to get a passenger removed from my upcoming trip \u2014 Sophia is no longer traveling with me on my round trip from Las Vegas to Denver, leaving May 19 and coming back May 20. I'm in a bit of a hurry, so I'd like this taken care of fast. I'll want her portion refunded to the original payment method I used.\nLook, I'm in a rush and this is frustrating. If you can't remove Sophia from the reservation, then just downgrade both of us \u2014 myself and Sophia \u2014 to basic economy on", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to remove Sophia from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to all agents, including human agents. You can modify passenger details (such as name or date of birth) without changing the count, but adding or removing a passenger is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, here are the options that are within policy:\n- **Modify passenger details** (e.g., correct a name or date of birth) without changing the number of passengers.\n- **Cancel the entire reservation** (if it qualifies for cancellation), and then book a new reservation for the remaining travelers.\n\nPlease let me know if you'd like to pursue either of these, and I'll need your user ID and reservation ID to proceed.\nassistant: I'll help you locate your reservation first. Let me look up your account details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1973-11-14\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"AAVMM8\", \"MQHHT6\", \"GV1N64\"]}\nassistant: I found your account. You have three reservations (AAVMM8, MQHHT6, GV1N64). Let me check each to find the Las Vegas to Denver round trip. I'll start with the first one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"AAVMM8\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT214\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#1", "task_desc": "I'm absolutely furious right now! My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle has been delayed, and I have no idea what's going on. I need to know exactly why this flight is delayed \u2014 this is completely unacceptable!\nLook, I don't have the exact date memorized off the top of my head, but the flight is HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle, and I'm Ethan Martin \u2014 my user ID is ethan_martin_2396. Can you pull it up with that?\n\nI'm seriously upset about this whole situation and I demand to know the reason th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your frustration with the delay. I can check the current status of flight HAT039 for you, but I'll need the date of the flight to look it up. Could you please provide the date (in YYYY-MM-DD format)?\n\nAlso, please note that I can confirm the flight status through my system, but the specific reason for the delay may not be available through my tools. If you'd like, I can also help you change or cancel the reservation once we confirm the details.\nassistant: Let me pull up your profile and reservation details to find the flight date.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_2942955\": {\"source\": \"certificat