{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis\u2014my reservation number is YAX4DR. I\u2019d like to change the cabin class for everyone on that booking to business. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825.\nThanks for the breakdown, but the $1,200 difference is quite a bit more than I\u2019m willing to pay. I can only spend up to $650 total on a class upgrade. Since that won\u2019t cover both of us, I\u2019d like to go ahead and upgrade just my companion, Noah, to business class instea", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To proceed with changing the cabin class, I'll need your user ID for verification. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you. I've retrieved your reservation. Before I can change the cabin to business, I need to check the current business-class prices for your flight segments to determine any price difference. Let me look those up.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT013\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"status\": \"avai