{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Raj Sanchez. I was on the phone recently with one of your customer support reps, and they mentioned that a service agent would be able to assist me with canceling a reservation I have. I'd like to get that cancellation sorted out.\nSure, my user ID is raj_sanchez_7340.\nI'm not sure which of those codes is the one I need. The trip I want to cancel is my flight from Philadelphia to LaGuardia. Could you pull up the details on those reservations so I can figure out which one that is?\nWait,", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like 'raj_sanchez_123'). Could you please provide that?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your account details to locate your reservation.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3R\"]}\nassistant: I found your account, Raj. You have the following reservations:\n\n- MZDDS4\n- 60RX9E\n- S5IK51\n- OUEA45\n- Q69X3R\n\nWhich reservation would you like to cancel? If you're not sure which one, let me know and I can pull up the details of each to help you identify it.\nassistant: I'll pull up the details of your reservations one by one to help you identify the Philadelphia (PHL) to LaGuardia (LGA) flight. Let me start.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"MZDDS4\", \"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_n", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "14#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mohamed Silva. My user ID is mohamed_silva_9265. I'd like to check how much I have on my gift cards and travel certificates, please.\nThank you, that's clear \u2014 so I have $327 total in gift cards and $1,000 total in certificates.\n\nNow, I'd like to change my upcoming reservation. I want to keep the same travel dates, but change it to the cheapest business class round trip available, whether it's direct or has connections. Could you look that up for me?\nUnderstood \u2014 since basic economy can't", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1986-09-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", 