{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm looking to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nSure, my user ID is mia_li_3668.\nThanks, but I notice both of those flights depart before 11am EST \u2014 HAT069 at 6am and HAT083 at 1am. I don't want to fly that early in the morning. I mentioned I'm okay with a one-stop flight if needed, so do you have any options leaving after 11am, either direct or with a stopover?\nI'd like to fly in economy class. Since you mentioned there are multiple one-stop options and I'd pre", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile to help with the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\"