{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "39#0", "task_desc": "Bonjour, I would like to cancel all of my upcoming flights, s'il vous pla\u00eet. I have a few reservations booked.\nYes, of course. My user id is amelia_davis_8890. I am Amelia Davis.\nAh, monsieur, I appreciate the list, but I must cancel ALL of my upcoming flights. The ones you say cannot be cancelled \u2014 the basic economy, UDMOP1 and XAZ3C0 \u2014 I want to cancel those also. Even if I receive no refund, c'est pas grave. I want to give up my seat for someone else who needs it, vous comprenez? \n\nFor the th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Bonjour! I'd be happy to help you cancel your upcoming flights. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"442 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 708\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92125\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.davis1624@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1984-03-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7397998\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7397998\", \"amount\": 74.0}, \"gift_card_1647044\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1647044\", \"amount\": 236.0}, \"credit_card_4074252\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4074252\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5435\"}, \"credit_card_6738701\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6738701\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5308\"}, \"credit_card_5799376\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5799376\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9326\"}, \"gift_card_5251654\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5251654\", \"amount\": 179.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Jackson\", \"dob\": \"1999-04-26\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"8C8K4E\", \"UDMOP1\", \"XAZ3C0\", \"LU15PA\", \"MSJ4OA\", \"I6M8JQ\", \"4XGCCM\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Amelia. You have 7 reservations: 8C8K4E, UDMOP1, XAZ3C0, LU15PA, MSJ4OA, I6M8JQ, and 4XGCCM. Let me retrieve the details of each to review the flights and check eligibility for cancellation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"8C8K4E\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_davis_8890\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT247\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MIA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 904}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT193\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 1906}], \"passengers\": [", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "30#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Las Vegas to Houston that currently has a layover, and I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight. Also, I want to remove the checked bag I added and get a refund for that.\nOkay, I understand about the checked bag \u2014 that\u2019s fine, we can leave it as is and move on. \n\nAs for my details, my user ID is james_taylor_7043 and my reservation ID is 1N99U6.\nI\u2019ll go with option 1 \u2014 HAT266 works perfectly for my schedule and it\u2019s the cheaper of the two. Please go ahead and ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I can help you with changing your flight to a nonstop option. However, I need to clarify a couple of things first, and I also need to note a policy limitation.\n\nFirst, to proceed, I'll need:\n1. Your **user ID** (required).\n2. Your **reservation ID**. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nRegarding the checked bag: Per our policy, passengers are able to **add** checked bags but **cannot remove** checked bags that were already added to a reservation, and refunds for removed bags are not permitted. So I'm afraid I won't be able to remove the checked bag or issue a refund for it. I can, however, help you change the flight to a nonstop option.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it)?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"1N99U6\", \"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 161}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT152\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 192}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT112\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"desti