{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Ugh, honestly I'm pretty frustrated right now. I just ran into some money troubles and I need to downgrade all of my business class flights to economy. I don't want to change any of the flight details or the passengers \u2014 just the cabin class. Can you help me sort this out?\nYeah, fine. My name's Omar Davis and my user ID is omar_davis_3817. Just please pull up my reservations so we can get this done \u2014 I really need to downgrade every single business flight to economy, no changes to the flights th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your situation. I can help you downgrade the cabin class from business to economy. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"JG7F