{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to change my flights. For my booking, I want to switch the outgoing flight to a nonstop one leaving the next day instead, and I also need to move my return from SFO one day later.\nSure, my name is Yara Garcia and my user ID is yara_garcia_1905. The reservation I'm calling about is HXDUBJ.\nThanks for the options. I have a specific time window I need to stick to \u2014 I only want flights departing after 8am and before 9pm.\n\nFor the outgoing flight, HAT180 leaves at 7am which is too early ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your flights, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide your **user ID** and **reservation ID**?\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it using your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"377 Pine L