{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia Kim. I need a bit of help with my travel plans. First, I have an existing reservation that includes a passenger I need to remove. Separately, I\u2019m also looking to book a new round-trip flight from New York to somewhere on the West Coast. Can you assist with both of those?\nThanks for clarifying the policy on passenger changes. Since removing Ethan from reservation H9ZU1C isn\u2019t possible, I\u2019d like you to go ahead and cancel that reservation \u2014 I\u2019ll rebook myself later.\n\nNow, for the new t", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Mia! I can help with your booking request, but I need to clarify a couple of things first.\n\n**Regarding removing a passenger from an existing reservation:**\nI'm sorry, but per our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this includes removing a passenger. Even a human agent is not able to change the number of passengers on a reservation. I'm not able to assist with that request.\n\n**Regarding booking a new round-trip flight from New York to the West Coast:**\nI'd be happy to help with this! To get started, I'll need a few details:\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `mia_kim_123`).\n2. **Your specific origin airport** in New York (e.g., JFK, LGA, or EWR).\n3. **Your specific destination airport** on the West Coast (e.g., LAX, SFO, SEA, etc.).\n\nOnce I have your user ID and these airport details, I can look up available flights for you. Please let me know!\nassistant: I'll help you with both tasks. Let me first look up the details of reservation H9ZU1C to verify the cancellation eligibility before proceeding.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1991-11-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1968-08-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_7359776\", \"amount\": 897}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T04:50:18\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved the reservation details. Before I can cancel, I need to verify the cancellation e", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 18, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "23#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I have a couple of things I need help with. First, I\u2019d like to know the total balance across all my gift cards and also the total balance across any certificates I have on file. Second, I want to change my recent flight reservation to the cheapest business class round trip available, but keeping the same travel dates. I don\u2019t mind whether it\u2019s a direct flight or has stops.\nSure, my user ID is mohamed_silva_9265.\nI understand \u2014 since you mentioned basic economy can\u2019t be changed per policy,", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I\u2019d be happy to help with both of those. To get started, I\u2019ll need your user ID so I can look up your payment methods and locate your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mohamed\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"638 Elm Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 548\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91365\"}, \"email\": \"mohamed.silva9198@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1960-11-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5843230\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5843230\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2395\"}, \"gift_card_8020792\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8020792\", \"amount\": 198.0}, \"certificate_3765853\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3765853\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_6136092\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6136092\", \"amount\": 129.0}, \"certificate_9984806\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9984806\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_2198526\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2198526\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9363\"}, \"certificate_2765295\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2765295\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1986-09-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Wilson\", \"dob\": \"1980-03-27\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"K1NW8N\"]}\nassistant: I\u2019ve retrieved your profile. Let me calculate your gift card and certificate balances and pull up your reservation details.\ntool: 327.0\ntool: 1000.0\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"K1NW8N\", \"user_id\": \"mohamed_silva_9265\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 53}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT204\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-2", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 13, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T21:07:06"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Aarav Ahmed. I need to cancel my upcoming trip from JFK to MCO on May 22. Since I'm a silver member with your airline, I should be eligible for a full refund on that booking. Can you process the cancellation and refund for me?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. The reason for cancellation is just a change of plans on my end. \n\nAnd just to be clear, I'm a silver member with your airline, so I should be getting a full refund on this cancellation \u2014 that's the policy for my tier. Can you ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Aarav! I'd be happy to help you cancel your trip. To proceed, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like 'aarav_ahmed_123') \u2014 this is required to locate your account and reservation.\n2. **The reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can look up your reservation for the JFK \u2192 MCO trip on May 22, 2024, and confirm the details before processing the cancellation.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your account and locate the reservation for your JFK \u2192 MCO trip on May 22, 2024.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card