{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm really stressed about my upcoming trip \u2014 I have a lot of things I need to bring with me, and it's super important that I get the baggage allowance exactly right. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, so I think that might give me some extra suitcase allowance. Could you help me figure out the total number of suitcases my reservation lets me take on the flight?\nSure, yes \u2014 I'm Anya Garcia, and my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. Like I said, I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, so I really need to", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you figure out your baggage allowance. To look up your membership level and reservation details, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your profile. I should note one correction: your membership level is actually **silver**, not gold \u2014 but that still gives you a generous baggage allowance.\n\nI see you have several reservations on file (82K959, 790JYN, BE2L57, CXBB4L, TAMSDK, 3RK2T9, VAOW1B, Q4MCUF, JMO1MG). To tell you the exact total number of suitcases allowed, I need to know which specific reservation you're asking about, since the allowance depends on the cabin class and number of passengers on that particular trip.\n\nCould you please provide the reservation ID for the trip you're concerned about? If you're not sure which one it is, let me know the destination or dates and I can help locate it.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have an upcoming return flight booked with you and I need to make a change to it. Currently it's a one-stop flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles, but I'd like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead. I don't want to book a new ticket \u2014 just modify my existing reservation.\nMy user ID is james_lee_6136. But you just told me that changing the destination from LAX to LAS can't be done through the modification process, which means the change I need isn't possible wit", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with your reservation. First, I'll need your **user ID** to locate your booking. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help find it once I have your user ID.\n\nHowever, I should let you know about an important policy constraint before we proceed: **modifications to a reservation cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type.** Since you'd like to change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), this specific change cannot be made through the modification process.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can look up your reservation and review your options?\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
