{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a reservation with you guys \u2014 ID YAX4DR \u2014 for a flight from Boston to Minneapolis coming up. I want to change the cabin class for everyone on the booking to business, and I also need to add two checked bags under my name. Can you help me sort that out?\nWait, $1,200 is quite a bit more than I wanted to spend. I mentioned earlier I\u2019m only willing to pay up to $650 for the business class upgrade. So I can\u2019t do both passengers. Instead, could you just upgrade my companion Noah Hernande", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with that. Let me first look up the reservation details to verify the information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I found your reservation. Let me gather a bit more information before proceeding \u2014 I'll check your user profile (for membership level and payment methods) and look up the business class prices for your flight segments.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \