{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#0", "task_desc": "I need to get a passenger removed from my flights ASAP. Sophia needs to be taken off my round trip from LAS to DEN \u2014 leaving May 19 and coming back May 20. I'm in a hurry, so can you just process that quickly?\nLook, this is frustrating \u2014 I told you I'm in a hurry. If you can't just take Sophia off the booking, then fine, downgrade all of us on that reservation to basic economy. Whatever gets it done fast. \n\nMy user ID is james_patel_9828. I don't have the reservation number memorized at the mome", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to process this request. According to our policy, while passenger details can be modified, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be changed \u2014 and even a human agent is not able to modify the number of passengers. Removing Sophia from your reservation would reduce the passenger count, which is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications that don't change the number of passengers, such as updating a passenger's name or date of birth, changing flights, cabin class, or adding checked bags. Please let me know if you'd like to explore any of those options, and I'll need your user ID and reservation ID to proceed.\nassistant: I understand you're in a hurry, but I'll need to first locate your reservation and review the details before making any changes. Let me look up your account.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1973-11-14\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"AAVMM8\", \"MQHHT6\", \"GV1N64\"]}\nassistant: I found your account. You have three reservations (AAVMM8, MQHHT6, GV1N64). Let me check the details of each to find the LAS\u2013DEN round trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"AAVMM8\", \"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT214\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1358}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#0", "task_desc": "Hello, for my upcoming trip from New York to Chicago, I\u2019d like to add 3 checked bags, change the passenger to myself, and upgrade to economy class.\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID handy, but you mentioned you can help locate it with that.\nYes, please go ahead and make all three changes. For the $209 cabin difference, I\u2019d like to pay with my gift card \u2014 the one with the $280 balance, gift_card_8190333.\nGreat, thank you for your help! Everything looks good. ###S", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. Could you please provide:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., 'ZFA04Y') \u2014 if you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"vi