{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest Economy class option\u2014but not Basic Economy. Also, since I live in Princeton, Newark is just as convenient for me as Philadelphia, so I\u2019d be open to looking at flights into EWR too. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is **aarav_garcia_1177**. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID in front of me right now, but hopefull", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you change your flight. To get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (so I can locate your reservation)\n2. **Your reservation ID** (if you have it \u2014 if not, I can help find it once I have your user ID)\n\nOne important note based on our booking policy: flight modifications **cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type**. This means I can help you move your flight to the day after your original travel date and look at Economy (not Basic Economy) options, but I **cannot change the destination from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR)**. The destination must remain PHL.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID so I can look up your reservation?\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations (M05KNL and UHDAHF). Let me pull up the details of both to find your Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL) flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nSure, my user ID is mia_li_3668.\nFor the departure airport, I didn't have a specific one in mind \u2014 any of JFK, LGA, or EWR is fine with me. \n\nCabin class: I'd like economy.\n\nPassenger details: just me, Mia Li \u2014 my birthday should already be in my profile, so no need to provide it again.\n\nI don't want travel insurance.\n\nAnd I'll have 3 checked bags.\nThanks, but I notice both of these flights depart before 11am EST \u2014 one a", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To get started with your booking, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1907\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1957-03-21\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"NO6JO3\", \"AIXC49\", \"HKEG34\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Mia. I've retrieved your profile \u2014 you're a gold member. \n\nTo search for flights, I need to know which New York airport you'd like to depart from, since New York has several (JFK, LGA, or EWR). Seattle's airport code is SEA.\n\nCould you please specify:\n1. Your departure airport in New York (JFK, LGA, or EWR)\n2. Your preferred cabin class (basic economy, economy, or business)\n3. Passenger details (first name, last name, and date of birth for each passenger \u2014 up to 5 passengers)\n4. Whether you'd like to purchase travel insurance ($30 per passenger, enables full refund for health/weather cancellations)\n5. How many checked bags you'll need\n\nOnce I have these, I'll search for available flights and confirm the booking details with you before proceeding.\nassistant: I'll search for available flights. Let me start by checking direct flights from JFK to SEA on May 20th.\ntool: [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT069\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm having an issue with my flight booking. I'm pretty sure I purchased travel insurance for my upcoming trip, but when I look at my booking details online, it's not showing up there at all. I'm traveling with my family and everyone else already has insurance on their flights, so I really need to make sure mine gets added too \u2014 it's important to me that we're all covered.\nOkay, here's my information \u2014 my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0. \n\nBut I really don't", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to add travel insurance to an existing reservation. According to our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking is made. Only checked bags can be added after booking, but insurance must be purchased at the time of booking.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you verify the current details of your reservation to confirm what is currently on file. To do that, I'll need your user ID and reservation ID. Please note that I cannot add insurance to your booking at this time.\nassistant: Let me look into your reservation details to verify the current information on file.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\"