{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I am absolutely furious right now. My flight HAT045 from PHX to SEA has been delayed, and because of this I'm going to miss a very important meeting. This is completely unacceptable!\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. I don't have the exact flight date in front of me right now, but it's the HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle that got delayed.\n\nAnd no \u2014 I do *not* want to change or cancel my reservation. I need to get to Seattle, the flight has to stay e", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay and the impact on your important meeting. As a Gold member, I'd like to help. To confirm the details and assist you, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide:\n1. Your user ID (e.g., 'sara_doe_496')\n2. The date of your flight HAT045 from PHX to SEA\n\nAlso, would you like to change or cancel this reservation due to the delay? (Per our policy, a compensation certificate for delayed flights is offered in connection with a change or cancellation of the reservation.)\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'll look into your reservation to confirm the delay. Let me pull up your details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_ca