{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I hope you're doing well. I have a few bookings with your airline that I need to adjust. Specifically, I'd like to cancel two of my upcoming reservations and change a third one to a nonstop flight if that's available. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure thing! My user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. I really appreciate you helping me sort this out. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nThank you for the detailed summary. I'm", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you with cancelling and modifying your reservations. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID so I can look up your bookings. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav. I can see you have four reservations: M20IZO, N6F783, IFOYYZ, and NQNU5R. Let me review the details of each so we can identify which two to cancel and which one to change to a nonstop flight.\n\nLet me start by pulling up the first reservation.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfr", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to a flight I have booked. I currently have a return flight from Atlanta to Los Angeles that has a stop, and I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.\n###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand you'd like to change your return flight from Atlanta (ATL) to Los Angeles (LAX) with a stop, to a nonstop flight from Atlanta (ATL) to Las Vegas (LAS).\n\nHowever, per the flight modification policy, a reservation can only be modified without changing the origin, destination, and trip type. Changing the destination from Los Angeles to Las Vegas is not permitted through the modification process. Since this request cannot be handled within the scope of my available actions, I'll transfer you to a human agent who may be able to assist with alternatives (such as canceling and rebooking).\n\nLet me connect you with a human agent.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "7#0", "task_desc": "I need to cancel my flights under reservation IDs XEHM4B and 59XX6W. I'm sick.\ndaiki_muller_1116. Other reasons \u2014 I'm sick.\nUpgrade XEHM4B to business first, then cancel it. Use CC ending 2135. Also, any other upcoming flights under my ID? Total cost of those? I'm sick.\nYes. Upgrade XEHM4B to business then cancel. Yes cancel 59XX6W. Sick.\n###STOP###", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To proceed with the cancellation, I'll need a few details first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (For example, something like \"sara_doe_496\".)\n\nAlso, just to confirm the reason for cancellation: you mentioned you're sick \u2014 is this for a health-related reason? The policy options for cancellation reason are: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons. Please let me know which applies.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"XEHM4B\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT005\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 65}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT178\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"price\": 83}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1954-07-04\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_2408938\", \"amount\": 296}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T05:17:41\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"59XX6W\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_muller_1116\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\":