{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel my flight reservation with confirmation code EHGLP3. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is emma_kim_9957.\nIt\u2019s basically a change of plan \u2014 I was out of town for that period, so I wasn\u2019t able to use the booking and now I need to cancel it.\nWait, that doesn't sound right to me. When I booked my previous trip through your agency, I was told I didn't need to purchase insurance this time because my earlier booking with you already included coverage. So shouldn't that ap", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. To proceed, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved your reservation. Before I can proceed with the cancellation, I need to know the reason for your cancellation. Could you please let me know the reason? (Options: change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons)\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to cancel this reservation based on our cancellation policy. Here's why:\n\n- **Booking time**: Your reservation was created on 2024-05-04, which is more than 24 hours ago, so the 24-hour cancellation window no longer applies.\n- **Airline cancellation**: Both flights (HAT156 and HAT021 on 2024-05-17) currently show as \"available\" \u2014 they have not been cancelled by the airline.\n- **Cabin class**: This is a basic economy reservation, not a business class booking.\n- **Travel insurance**: This reservation does not include travel insurance.\n\nPer our policy, a flight can only be cancelled if one of the following is true: the booking was made within the last 24 hours, the flight was cancelled by the airline, it is a business class flight, or the user has travel insurance covering the reason for cancellatio", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hello. I'm a bit worried because I booked a flight for myself and my family, and I'm pretty sure I selected travel insurance when I made the booking. But now when I check my trip details online, it's not listed there. Everyone else in my family already has insurance on their flights, so I really need to make sure mine is added too. Can you help me sort this out?\nMy user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0.\n\nBut wait \u2014 I really need to insist on this. I'm flying with my ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern. However, I need to let you know that according to our policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking** has been made. This is a firm rule, so I'm unable to add insurance to your reservation at this point.\n\nThat said, I can help you verify the current insurance status on your reservation to confirm whether it was actually included at the time of booking. To do that, I'll need a couple of details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`)\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., `ZFA04Y`) \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it)? I'll then look up the details so we can confirm exactly what's on file.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've pulled up your reservation **PEP4E0** (user ID `sophia_taylor_9065`). Here's what the system shows:\n\n- **Trip:** One-way, CLT \u2192 PHX (flights HAT176 and HAT097 on 2024-05-20)\n- **Cabin:** Basic economy\n- **Passenger:** Sophia Taylor\n- **Insurance:** **No** (confirmed not on file)\n- **Created:** 2024-05-05\n\nI understand your frustration, especially since the rest of your family has coverage. However, I have to be clear and firm on this: **our policy does not allow travel insurance to be added after", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "32#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to change my upcoming flight from Newark (EWR) on May 21 to a nonstop flight on the same day. My mother is really sick and I need to get back home sooner to take care of her.\nMy user ID is ivan_rossi_8555. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but hopefully you can locate it with that.\nOh, I see it's a Basic Economy fare. But I'm willing to upgrade to regular Economy so I can make the change \u2014 I don't want to buy a new ticket, just upgrade this existing reservation. I can pay up to $1", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your mother. I'd be happy to help you change your flight. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, if you have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_rossi_8555\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"513 Main Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 805\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19102\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.rossi2633@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1954-01-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_7344518\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7344518\", \"amount\": 183.0}, \"gift_card_9823297\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9823297\", \"amount\": 224.0}, \"credit_card_9659780\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9659780\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1777\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-01-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1990-06-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"OWZ4XL\", \"F3IQK1\", \"8WMF4C\", \"L2H5FP\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. Yo