{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Raj Brown. I'm calling because I've been dealing with a health issue and I had purchased trip insurance for my upcoming reservation VA5SGQ, which is currently a roundtrip from Detroit to LaGuardia. I\u2019d like to change that booking to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back on the same dates, and since I have the insurance, I need any change fees waived. Also, I only want early morning flights that arrive at the destination before 7am, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest regular Econo", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with modifying your reservation. Let me first look up the details of your reservation to find your user ID and the current flight information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT106\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 135}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1967-03-12\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_8003957\", \"amount\": 686}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T18:28:13\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you for providing those details. Let me look up your user profile to confirm your information.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\