{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "This is Sophia Silva, and I am absolutely furious right now. I had a business flight booked earlier this month that got canceled on me, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. I need to talk to someone about getting compensated for this mess and the inconvenience it caused me.\nYes, it's sophia_silva_7557. But honestly, I don't see why I should have to jump through hoops here \u2014 your airline canceled my flight, I missed a critical business meeting because of it, and now ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your experience. To look into this and confirm the details of your canceled flight, I'll need to access your account information. Could you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: I understand your frustration. Let me look up your account and reservation details to confirm what happened.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Let me review your reservations to confirm the canceled business flight. I'll check all of them.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-0", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Mei Brown. I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm calling to complain about my flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle being delayed. I am extremely upset because this delay is going to make me miss a very important meeting, and as a loyal customer I expect to be compensated appropriately for this inconvenience.\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. \n\nBut to be clear, I do **not** want to change or cancel my flight \u2014 HAT045 must stay exactly as booked. I need to get to Seattle, jus", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the delay with your flight HAT045. As a Gold member, I'd like to help. \n\nTo confirm the facts and assist you, I'll need a few details first:\n1. Your user ID (so I can locate your reservation).\n2. Per our policy, compensation for a delayed flight is offered as a certificate only if you would like to **change or cancel** the affected reservation. Could you let me know if you'd like to change or cancel your reservation for this delayed flight?\n\nOnce I have your user ID and your preference to change or cancel, I'll verify the flight status and reservation details before proceeding.\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I appreciate your loyalty as a Gold member. However, I must follow our airline's established compensation policy.\n\nPer our policy, compensation for a delayed flight is offered as a certificate **only** when the affected reservation is changed or cancelled. Since you've confirmed you do not wish to change or cancel flight HAT045 and want it to remain exactly as booked, I'm unable to offer compensation for this delay under the current policy.\n\nThe only compensation scenarios covered by our policy are:\n- A **cancelled** flight in a reservation \u2014 certificate of $100 per passenger (after confirming the facts)\n- A **delayed** flight where the reservation is **changed or cancelled** \u2014 certificate of $50 per passenger (after confirming the facts and processing the change/cancellation)\n\nI'm not permitted to offer compensation for any other reason.\n\nIf you reconsider and would like to change or cancel your reservation for HAT045, I can verify the flight status and reservation details and then process that for you, after which a compensation certificate could be offered. Otherwise, I'm unable to provide compensation while the flight remains as booked.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with regarding your reservation?\nassistant: I understand this is disappointing, and I hear your", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'd like to cancel my upcoming flight from JFK to MCO on May 22. Since I'm a silver member, I'm entitled to a full refund.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. The reason for cancellation is just a change of plans \u2014 I need to book a different trip instead. And just to be clear, since I'm a silver member, I should be getting a full refund on this cancellation.\nWait, no \u2014 I absolutely do not want to be transferred to a human agent. You can handle this right here. I'm a silver member, and I ne", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? Once I have that, I can help find your reservation for the JFK to MCO flight on May 22.\n\nI'll also need the **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons) before I can proceed.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ