{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I have a flight booked from Atlanta to Philadelphia that I need to change. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original travel date, and I\u2019m hoping to find the cheapest option in regular Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, just so you know, I live in Princeton, so both Newark and Philadelphia are equally convenient for me. Could we look at flights into either airport?\nSure, my name is Aarav Garcia and my user ID is aarav_garcia_1177. I don\u2019t have my reservation ID handy at the mome", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you change your flight. \n\nBefore I can proceed, I need a few details:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. **Your reservation ID** \u2014 if you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOne important note regarding your request: per our modification policy, a reservation can be changed **without altering the origin, destination, or trip type**. Since your original booking is from Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL), I won't be able to change the destination to Newark (EWR). I can only look at flights into Philadelphia for the day after your original travel date in Economy class.\n\nPlease provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it), and I'll help you find the available Economy options for the new date.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations using your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **M05KNL** and **UHDAHF**. Let me check the details of both to find your Atlanta \u2192 Philadelphia booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
