{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "30#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have an upcoming flight from LAS to IAH that currently has a stop, and I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight. I also want to remove my checked bag and get a refund for that bag fee. Can you help me with these changes?\nOkay, I understand about the checked bag \u2014 that\u2019s a bit disappointing, but I\u2019ll accept that and move on.\n\nAs for my info, my name is James Taylor. My user ID is james_taylor_7043 and my reservation ID is 1N99U6.\n\nSo, going back to the main thing \u2014 I\u2019d like to change my up", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I can help you look into changing your flight from LAS to IAH to a nonstop option. However, I need to clarify a couple of things first:\n\n1. **Checked bag removal:** Per our policy, passengers are able to *add* checked bags but cannot *remove* them after booking, so I won't be able to remove your checked bag or refund the bag fee. I apologize for the inconvenience.\n\n2. **Your information:** To proceed with the flight change, I'll need your **user ID** and **reservation ID**. If you don't have your reservation ID handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID (and reservation ID if you have it)?\nassistant: Thank you for providing your information. Let me first pull up your reservation details to understand your current booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"1N99U6\", \"user_id\": \"james_taylor_7043\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 161}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT152\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 192}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT112\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 184}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1997-01-23\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1975-09-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5634230\", \"amount\": 1134}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-08T11:37:17\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved your reservation. Here's a summary of your current booking:\n\n- **Reservation:** 1N99U6\n- **Trip type:** Round trip (LAS \u2194 IAH)\n- **Cabin:** Economy\n- **Outbound (2024-05-19):** LAS \u2192 PHX (HAT284) \u2192 IAH (HAT152) \u2014 this is your one-stop segment\n- **Return (2024-05-27):** IAH \u2192 LAS (HAT112) \u2014 already nonstop\n- ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 3, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "27#1", "task_desc": "I'm absolutely furious right now! My flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle was delayed and nobody has given me a straight answer about what's going on. I need to know why this happened.\nLook, I don't have the exact date memorized right this second, but my name is Ethan Martin and my user ID is ethan_martin_2396 \u2014 you should be able to pull up my booking with that! \n\nThis is ridiculous. I was supposed to be on flight HAT039 from Atlanta to Seattle and it's been delayed, and I'm sitting here with ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your frustration. I can look up the status of flight HAT039 to confirm the delay. However, I'll need the date of the flight to check its status. Could you please provide the date (in YYYY-MM-DD format) for your flight from Atlanta (ATL) to Seattle (SEA)?\n\nPlease note that I can confirm the flight status through our system, but I may not have access to the specific reason for the delay.\nassistant: I'll look up your booking using your user ID. Let me pull up your details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"157 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 744\", \"city\": \"Dallas\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"75202\"}, \"email\": \"ethan.martin2913@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-05-18\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_5449394\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_5449394\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_5853954\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5853954\", \"amount\": 71.0}, \"certificate_7365778\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7365778\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_2942955\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_2942955\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_5447957\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5447957\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"8023\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Johnson\", \"dob\": \"1976-08-23\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"GXWCPN\", \"DQST39\", \"BSSSM3\", \"RVQC22\", \"P824NH\", \"3HE6QG\", \"NTIRXF\", \"HG8X9P\", \"M61CQM\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Ethan. You have several reservations. I need to locate the one with flight HAT039 from Atlanta (ATL) to Seattle (SEA). Let me check your reservations one by one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"GXWCPN\", \"user_id\": \"ethan_martin_2396\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT065\", \"origin\": \"LGA\", \"destination\": \"", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 12, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Ugh, I'm so frustrated right now. I just ran into some serious money problems and I need to downgrade all my business class flights to economy. I don't want to change any of the flights or the passengers\u2014just the cabin class. Can you help me with that?\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. Look, I'm stressed enough as it is with these money issues \u2014 I just need to get all my business flights downgraded to economy, same flights, same passengers, okay? Just do what you can.\nYes, go ahead and ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your situation. I can help you change the cabin class from business to economy. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Could you please provide it? If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations to find the relevant bookings.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"firs