{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "35#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to cancel an upcoming flight I booked with you. Could you assist with that?\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. I need to cancel my flight from JFK to MCO on May 22. And just so you know, I'm a silver member, so I should be getting a full refund on this cancellation.\nBut that doesn't make sense \u2014 I'm a silver member! Loyalty program benefits should absolutely apply here. Silver members get a full refund when cancelling, that's part of my tier perks. I really need you to process this", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you cancel your flight. To get started, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Let me look up your account details and reservations to locate the booking.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: I've confirmed you're a silver member. Now let me locate the specific reservation for your JFK to MCO flight on May 22 by checking your reservations.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_baggages\": 1, \"non", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 10, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#1", "task_desc": "Ugh, I'm really frustrated right now. I just hit some financial trouble and I can't keep paying for business class. I need to downgrade *all* of my booked business flights to economy \u2014 but I don't want to change any of the flights themselves or the passenger details, just the cabin. Can you sort that out for me?\nYeah, fine. It's omar_davis_3817. Name's Omar Davis. Just please pull up everything I've got booked in business and get them downgraded to economy \u2014 I can't afford this anymore.\nUgh, fin", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your financial trouble. I can help you downgrade the cabin class from business to economy while keeping the same flights and passengers.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide that?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1990-10-11\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"JG7FMM\", \"LQ940Q\", \"2FBBAH\", \"X7BYG1\", \"EQ1G6C\", \"BOH180\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Omar. You have 6 reservations. Let me pull up the details of each to identify which ones are booked in business class.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"JG7FMM\", \"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1859}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"price\": 1679}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Fatima\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1950-05-04\"}], \"payment_histo", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 24, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T03:38:35"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "33#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a reservation under the code HXDUBJ. I need to make a couple of changes to my trip \u2014 I\u2019d like to change my upcoming outgoing flight to a nonstop flight, but pushed back by one day. I also need to move my return flight from SFO one day later. Can you help me with that?\nThanks for the options. I do have a specific time preference though \u2014 I only want flights that depart after 8am and before 9pm. \n\nLooking at what you sent, HAT180 leaves at 7:00am which is too early f", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with those changes. Let me first look up your reservation details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Thank you. I found your reservation. Let me confirm your user profile and payment methods before proceeding.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"377 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 694\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\":