{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "10#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I've got a flight from Houston to Seattle on May 23 that I need to push back to May 24. And for that same flight, I'd like to upgrade everyone in my party to business class. Can you help me sort that out?\nSure, my user ID is liam_khan_2521. I don't have my reservation ID in front of me right now \u2014 is there a way you can look it up using that?\nWait, I think there might be a misunderstanding. I only asked to upgrade the outbound flight from IAH to SEA to business class \u2014 not the return flights", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you modify your flight. To get started, I'll need a few details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., something like `sara_doe_496`).\n2. Your **reservation ID** (e.g., `ZFA04Y`). If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID and reservation ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"liam_khan_2521\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Khan\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"626 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 707\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10148\"}, \"email\": \"liam.khan7273@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1979-09-27\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_9254323\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9254323\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"gift_card_7194529\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_7194529\", \"amount\": 62.0}, \"credit_card_7434610\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7434610\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9448\"}, \"credit_card_7231150\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7231150\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"3422\"}, \"certificate_1849235\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1849235\", \"amount\": 250.0}}, \"saved_passeng