{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#1", "task_desc": "Hello... I... I don't even know where to start. My wife... she died yesterday. It's just... it's devastating. I have a flight booked that I need to change. I can't go on the original date, I just can't. I need to push it back a couple of days. I don't want to cancel, just... just move the date. Please, I need help with this.\nI... my name is Lucas Brown. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. That's all I can barely think straight right now. She's just... gone. I had that trip planned with her and now I", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. I'll help you modify your flight reservation to a later date.\n\nTo get started, I'll need a couple of details:\n1. Your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\").\n2. Your **reservation ID** (for example, something like \"ZFA04Y\"). If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: I'm sorry again for your loss. Let me look up your reservations to find the one you'd like to modify.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"379 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 757\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32230\"}, \"email\": \"lucas.brown9700@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_3138963\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3138963\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_7872117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7872117\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"8056\"}, \"gift_card_5205020\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5205020\", \"amount\": 86.0}, \"gift_card_9049233\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9049233\", \"a