{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#0", "task_desc": "Hi, this is Ivan Muller. I have a current reservation with your airline, and I\u2019d like to book the exact same itinerary for my friend Ivan Smith, who is listed in my profile. Could you help me set that up?\nSure, my user ID is ivan_muller_7015.\nThanks for pulling that up. To answer your questions:\n\n- No, I don't want to add travel insurance for him.\n- He doesn't need any checked bags \u2014 traveling light, so zero bags beyond the free allowance.\n- On payment: I had initially thought about using my tra", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Ivan! I'd be happy to help you book the same itinerary for your friend Ivan Smith.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID first. Could you please provide your user ID?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: Thank you! I can see you have a reservation (G72NSF) and your friend Ivan Smith is in your saved passengers. Let me pull up the details of your curre