{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "15#0", "task_desc": "I need to change my flight from Atlanta to Philadelphia. I\u2019d like to move it to the day after my original reservation, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest fare in regular Economy class\u2014not Basic Economy. Also, I live in Princeton, so Newark is just as easy for me to get to, so I\u2019d like to consider flights into EWR as well if that helps find a better price.\nOh, I see \u2014 I didn\u2019t realize the destination couldn\u2019t be changed, so I\u2019ll stick with the ATL to PHL route then. My user ID is aarav_garcia_1177.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your flight, I'll need a few details first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, I should note that per our modification policy, a reservation can be changed **without altering the origin, destination, or trip type**. This means the destination cannot be changed from Philadelphia (PHL) to Newark (EWR) \u2014 only the flight date and/or specific flights on the same ATL\u2192PHL route can be modified. I can certainly help you find the cheapest regular Economy (not Basic Economy) fare for the day after your original reservation on the ATL\u2192PHL route.\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, just let me know and I can look it up once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"833 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 740\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80211\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.garcia6639@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_7473723\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7473723\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_8887175\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8887175\", \"amount\": 35.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lei\", \"last_name\": \"Ito\", \"dob\": \"1990-12-07\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"M05KNL\", \"UHDAHF\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations (M05KNL and UHDAHF). Let me check both to find your Atlanta (ATL) to Philadelphia (PHL) flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M05KNL\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_garcia_1177\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT227\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 1936}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT139\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"PHL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"price\": 851}], \"passengers\": [{\"firs", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "22#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make some changes to my upcoming trip from New York to Chicago. I'd like to change the passenger to myself, upgrade the ticket to economy class, and have 3 checked bags.\nMy user ID is omar_rossi_1241. I don't have my reservation ID handy, but you mentioned you can help locate it with that.\nYes, I confirm those changes. I'd like to use the gift card `gift_card_8190333` to cover the $209 difference.\nGreat, thank you for your help! Everything looks good.\n\n###STOP###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you modify your reservation, I'll need some information first. \n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127.0}, \"credit_card_7407366\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7407366\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"6437\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Liam\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-08-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"UM3OG5\", \"5RJ7UH\", \"FQ8APE\", \"QKRY03\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have several reservations: **UM3OG5, 5RJ7UH, FQ8APE, QKRY03**. Let me look up the details to find your New York to Chicago trip.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"UM3OG5\", \"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT113\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"DFW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"price\": 117}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT282\", \"origin\": \"DFW\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 140}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT239\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"SEA\",", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#0", "task_desc": "Hi there. I have an upcoming flight from Boston to Minneapolis under reservation ID YAX4DR. I\u2019d like to make a couple of changes to my booking \u2014 can you pull up that reservation for me first?\nYes, that's correct \u2014 my user ID is chen_lee_6825, and I'm Chen Lee.\n\nI'd like to make two changes to this reservation:\n1. I want to upgrade the cabin class for **both passengers** (myself and Noah Hernandez) from Economy to Business.\n2. I'd also like to add **2 checked bags** under my name. I have a Gold m", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll pull up that reservation for you now.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: I've retrieved your reservation. Here are the details:\n\n- **Reservation ID:** YAX4DR\n- **User ID:** chen_lee_6825\n- **Trip Type:** One-way (Boston BOS \u2192 Minneapolis MSP, with a stop in Orlando MCO)\n- **Cabin:** Economy\n- **Flights:**\n  - HAT235: BOS \u2192 MCO on 2024-05-18 ($122)\n  - HAT298: MCO \u2192 MSP on 2024-05-19 ($127)\n- **Passengers:** Chen Lee (DOB 1967-12-12), Noah Hernandez (DOB 1968-01-06)\n- **Payment:** credit_card_4938634 ($498)\n- **Baggages:** 0\n- **Travel Insurance:** No\n\nBefore I proceed with any changes, please confirm your **user ID** is **chen_lee_6825**, and let me know what specific changes you'd like to make to this booking.\nassistant: Thank you for confirming. Let me gather the necessary information to calculate the business class upgrade cost and verify your membership and flight status.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"355 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 365\", \"city\": \"San Francisco\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"94178\"}, \"email\": \"chen.lee7831@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6730850\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\":", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm calling because I booked a flight for myself and my family, and I'm pretty sure I added travel insurance for my own ticket when I booked it. But when I look at my booking online, the insurance isn't showing up for me. Everyone else in my family already has their insurance listed on their flights, so I really need to get this fixed on mine.\nI really don't want to be transferred to another agent \u2014 I'd like you to handle this for me directly. I'm positive I selected travel insurance for my ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to help with adding travel insurance to an existing reservation. According to our policy, travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking \u2014 it can only be purchased at the time the reservation is created. There is no option to modify or add insurance to a booking once it has been made, even if it was intended to be included originally.\n\nIf you'd like, I can look up your reservation to confirm the current insurance details on file, but I won't be able to add insurance to your ticket. Please note that I also cannot change the number of passengers or remove insurance that is already present.\n\nIf you believe there was a genuine error at the time of booking, I can transfer you to a human agent who may be able to review the situation further. Would you like me to do that, or would you like me to look up your reservation details first?\nassistant: I understand your frustration, and I'm sorry, but I'm not able to add travel insurance to your reservation at this point. Our policy is explicit that travel insurance can only be purchased at the time the booking is created, and it cannot be added to an existing reservation afterward. There is also no tool or process available to me to modify insurance on a booking that has already been made.\n\nBecause this is a firm policy rule \u2014 not just a limitation on my end \u2014 I'm unable to add the insurance to your ticket, and I cannot make an exception here.\n\nIf it would help, I can look up reservation PEP4E0 under your user ID (sophia_taylor_9065) to confirm exactly what insurance details are currently on file for you and your family. That way we can at least verify the current state of the booking. Would you like me to do that? Please note that even after confirming, I still won't be able to add insurance to your ticket.\nassistant: I understand you believe this is a booking error rather than a request to add new coverage, and I hear your frustration. Ho", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 0, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "1#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Raj Sanchez. I actually spoke with one of your customer support reps on the phone recently, and they told me that a service agent would be able to help me cancel a reservation I have. I'm hoping to get that taken care of now.\nSure, my user ID is **raj_sanchez_7340**. I don't have the reservation ID handy right now, but hopefully you can look up my bookings with that.\nI'd like to cancel the Philadelphia to LaGuardia trip \u2014 that's the round trip with reservation ID **Q69X3R**. The reason i", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj! I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like `raj_sanchez_123`). Could you please provide that? \n\nAlso, if you happen to know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it handy, I can help locate it for you once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"794 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 598\", \"city\": \"Charlotte\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NC\", \"zip\": \"28271\"}, \"email\": \"raj.sanchez1048@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1965-09-13\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_7891819\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_7891819\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"4388\"}, \"gift_card_4964153\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_4964153\", \"amount\": 163.0}, \"gift_card_3226531\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3226531\", \"amount\": 50.0}, \"certificate_4594761\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4594761\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"gift_card_1591784\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1591784\", \"amount\": 57.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Olivia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1976-06-27\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"MZDDS4\", \"60RX9E\", \"S5IK51\", \"OUEA45\", \"Q69X3R\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile, Raj. You have **5 reservations** on file: `MZDDS4`, `60RX9E`, `S5IK51`, `OUEA45`, and `Q69X3R`. \n\nLet me pull up the details of each so we can identify the one you'd like to cancel.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"MZDDS4\", \"user_id\": \"raj_sanchez_7340\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT050\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 1305}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT228\", \"origin\": \"LAX\", \"destination\": \"E", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "3#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm really stressed about my upcoming trip. I need to know exactly how many suitcases my reservation lets me bring on the flight \u2014 I have a ton of things I need to take with me and it's really important that the information be correct. I'm pretty sure I'm a Gold member, by the way. Can you help me find out?\nOkay, my user ID is anya_garcia_5901. I'm Anya Garcia. Like I said, I'm really stressed about this trip because I have so much to pack and I need the bag allowance to be exactly right. I ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you find out how many checked bags your reservation allows. To look this up, I'll need your user ID. If you don't know your reservation ID, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID?\nassistant: Let me look up your user profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"anya_garcia_5901\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"555 Highland Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 243\", \"city\": \"San Antonio\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78256\"}, \"email\": \"anya.garcia8816@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1992-11-12\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_2550356\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_2550356\", \"amount\": 149.0}, \"certificate_7583008\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7583008\", \"amount\": 150.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1989-12-13\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"82K959\", \"790JYN\", \"BE2L57\", \"CXBB4L\", \"TAMSDK\", \"3RK2T9\", \"VAOW1B\", \"Q4MCUF\", \"JMO1MG\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your profile. I notice a couple of things I should clarify before I can give you the exact bag allowance:\n\n1. **Membership level:** Your profile shows you are a **silver** member, not gold. This affects your free checked-bag allowance.\n2. **Multiple reservations:** You currently have **9 reservations** on file (IDs: 82K959, 790JYN, BE2L57, CXBB4L, TAMSDK, 3RK2T9, VAOW1B, Q4MCUF, JMO1MG).\n\nSince the bag allowance depends on the cabin class and number of passengers for a specific reservation, I'll need to know **which reservation** you're asking about. Could you tell me the reservation ID for the trip you're packing for? If you're not sure which one it is, let me know the destination or dates and I can help narrow it down.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 2, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "17#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked from New York to Chicago coming up. I need to make a few changes: I'd like to add three checked bags to the reservation, change the passenger name to myself (I'm Omar Rossi), and also upgrade the ticket to economy class. Can you help me with those?\nSure, my user ID is omar_rossi_1241.\nYes, I confirm all three changes \u2014 adding the 3 checked bags, changing the passenger to myself (Omar Rossi), and upgrading to economy. \n\nAs for payment, I prefer to use a gift card. Pleas", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with those changes. First, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? (This is typically in a format like \"firstname_lastname_123\".)\n\nAlso, if you don't know your **reservation ID**, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and reservations.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_rossi_1241\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"901 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 360\", \"city\": \"Houston\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"77271\"}, \"email\": \"omar.rossi5980@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1970-06-06\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_8190333\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8190333\", \"amount\": 280.0}, \"credit_card_6754990\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6754990\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3848\"}, \"certificate_8390038\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8390038\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"certificate_1778167\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1778167\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_6490722\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6490722\", \"amount\": 127