{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "0#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to cancel a flight reservation I have booked. The confirmation code is EHGLP3.\nSure, my user ID is emma_kim_9957. \n\nAs for the reason \u2014 I need to cancel because I won't be able to take the trip. I know it's probably been more than 24 hours since I booked it, but that's only because I was out of town and couldn't deal with it until now.\nWait, but I was specifically told when I booked this that I didn't need to purchase insurance this time \u2014 because my previous trip was booked throug", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your reservation, I'll need a few more details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., 'sara_doe_496').\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide these?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EHGLP3\", \"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT156\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 50}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT021\", \"origin\": \"SEA\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 54}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Evelyn\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Anya\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1971-11-22\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"amount\": 208}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T23:12:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"emma_kim_9957\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Emma\", \"last_name\": \"Kim\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"109 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 171\", \"city\": \"Philadelphia\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"PA\", \"zip\": \"19151\"}, \"email\": \"emma.kim3947@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1977-09-23\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_5832574\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5832574\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"5241\"}, \"gift_card_9562694\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_9562694\", \"amount\": 103.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Mason\", \"last_name\": \"Gonzalez\", \"dob\": \"1952-04-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1983-05-15\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"EHGLP3\", \"66EEUA\", \"MDCLVA\", \"H1QGCY\"]}\nassistant: Let me check the status of your flights to determine eligibility for cancellation.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've reviewed your r", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 7, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#0", "task_desc": "I am absolutely furious right now! I had a business flight booked earlier this month that your airline canceled on me, and because of that I ended up missing a really important meeting. This whole situation caused me a ton of inconvenience and I expect to be compensated for it.\nIt's sophia_silva_7557. But honestly, I don't see why I should have to jump through hoops here \u2014 your airline canceled my flight and I missed a critical business meeting because of it. I want to be compensated for both th", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience caused by the canceled flight. To confirm the details and assist you with compensation, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your user ID? This will help me locate your reservation and verify the cancellation.\nassistant: I understand your frustration. Let me look up your account to verify the details of the canceled flight.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1