{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "36#0", "task_desc": "Hello... I'm sorry, I'm just... I'm a mess right now. My wife died yesterday, it's... it's just tragic. I have a flight booked and I need to move it back a couple of days. I don't want to cancel it or anything, I just need to change the date. Can you help me with that?\nThank you... I just... I can barely think straight. My user ID is lucas_brown_4047. And the reservation... it's EUJUY6. That's the one I need to change. I just need to move it out two days because... because of what happened. I ca", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry for your loss. I'll help you change the date of your flight.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. If you also have your reservation ID handy, please share that as well\u2014if not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: I'm so sorry. Let me look up your reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"EUJUY6\", \"user_id\": \"lucas_brown_4047\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT238\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DEN\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 96}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT290\", \"origin\": \"DEN\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"price\": 64}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT266\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 70}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT044\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 76}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\", \"dob\": \"1965-01-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Thomas\", \"dob\": \"1996-06-21\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lopez\", \"dob\": \"1967-04-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"