{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "28#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Amelia Rossi. I have a booking with reservation ID SI5UKW and I need to cancel those flights. I'd like to get a refund for them \u2014 can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is amelia_rossi_1297. As for the reason, it's a change of plans \u2014 something personal came up and I won't be able to take the trip. I really need to get those flights cancelled and a refund issued for reservation SI5UKW.\nI'm sorry, but I really can't accept that as a final answer. I've been a loyal customer of this", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you cancel your reservation SI5UKW. To proceed, I'll need a couple of details:\n\n1. Your **user ID** (e.g., a format like `amelia_rossi_123`).\n2. The **reason for cancellation** (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons).\n\nCould you please provide these?\nassistant: Thank you. Let me look up your reservation details to verify the information before proceeding.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"SI5UKW\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_rossi_1297\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT062\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"LAS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"price\": 67}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT284\", \"origin\": \"LAS\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 57}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1960-01-19\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4579924\", \"amount\": 124}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-11T00:08:57\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me verify the flight status to ensure no portion of the trip has already been flown and check the cancellation eligibility.\ntool: available\ntool: available\nassistant: I've reviewed your reservation SI5UKW and the relevant details. Based on our cancellation policy, a flight can only be cancelled (and refunded) if one of the following applies:\n\n- The booking was made within the last 24 hours, **or**\n- The flight is cancelled by the airline, **or**\n- It is a business class flight, **or**\n- The user has travel insurance covering the cancellation reason.\n\nHere is what I found for your reservation:\n\n- **Booking date:** 2024-05-11 00:08:57 \u2014 this is more than 24 hours ago (current time is 2024-05-15 15:00:00 EST).\n- **Flight status:** Both flights (HAT062 on 2024-05-16 and HAT284 on 2024-05-17) are currently **available** \u2014 they have not been cancelled by the airline.\n- **Ca", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "13#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to make a change to my upcoming return flight. I currently have a one-stop flight booked from Atlanta to Los Angeles, and I'd like to switch it to a nonstop flight from Atlanta to Las Vegas instead.\nI understand, but I really don't want to cancel and book a new flight\u2014I only want to change my existing reservation to a nonstop ATL to LAS flight. Since you're saying that isn't possible on your end, I'd like to be transferred to someone who can help with this kind of modification. Also, ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to make this change. According to our policy, flight modifications cannot change the origin, destination, or trip type of a reservation. Since you'd like to change the destination from Los Angeles (LAX) to Las Vegas (LAS), this falls outside what I'm permitted to modify.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with changes that keep the same origin and destination (such as switching to a different flight on the same route, changing the cabin class, updating baggage, or modifying passenger details). Alternatively, you may need to cancel the existing reservation and book a new one to Las Vegas \u2014 though please note that cancellation is subject to our cancellation rules.\n\nLet me know how you'd like to proceed, and please provide your user ID and reservation ID so I can assist further.\ntool: Transfer successful\nassistant: YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON.", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 1, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "5#0", "task_desc": "I need to complain about my flight HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle. I'm a valued Gold member with your airline, and I'm absolutely furious because this delay is going to make me miss a really important meeting! I can't believe this is happening.\nMy user ID is mei_brown_7075. As for the exact date of the flight, I don't have that handy right now \u2014 but it's the HAT045 from Phoenix to Seattle that got delayed. Can you pull it up with my ID?\n\nAnd just to be clear, I'm a valued Gold member and I'm sti", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your frustration with the delay. To help you and confirm the details, I'll need a few pieces of information:\n\n1. Your user ID (so I can verify your Gold membership and locate your reservation)\n2. The date of flight HAT045 (so I can check its current status)\n\nCould you please provide these?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mei\", \"last_name\": \"Brown\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"853 Chestnut Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 497\", \"city\": \"Washington\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"DC\", \"zip\": \"20195\"}, \"email\": \"mei.brown7062@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1986-12-14\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_6761175\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_6761175\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"gift_card_8987598\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8987598\", \"amount\": 130.0}, \"credit_card_4920843\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4920843\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"1663\"}, \"credit_card_1815425\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1815425\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"9812\"}, \"certificate_1585255\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_1585255\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_5667188\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_5667188\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8764\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yusuf\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-03-03\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DB1Y70\", \"MUGYUB\", \"3JA7XV\", \"CYPIDV\"]}\nassistant: I've pulled up your profile. I notice a discrepancy I should flag: your profile shows a **regular** membership level, not Gold as you mentioned. I'll keep that in mind as I look into your reservation.\n\nYou have four reservations (DB1Y70, MUGYUB, 3JA7XV, CYPIDV). Let me check each to find the one with flight HAT045 from Phoenix (PHX) to Seattle (SEA).\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DB1Y70\", \"user_id\": \"mei_brown_7075\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 5, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "24#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm Mia Kim \u2014 my user ID is mia_kim_4397. I have a reservation under that with the confirmation code H9ZU1C, and I need to get a passenger named Ethan taken off of it. Can you help me with that?\nOh, I see. Well, if you can't remove Ethan from the reservation, then I'd like to cancel the whole thing \u2014 H9ZU1C under my name Mia Kim. That way I can rebook myself later. Can you go ahead and cancel it for me?\nAlright, I understand \u2014 if you can't cancel it, then I'll just leave that reservation as ", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to help with removing a passenger from your reservation. According to our policy, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be modified \u2014 this applies to all agents, including human agents. You can modify passenger details (such as names or dates of birth) without changing the number of passengers, but adding or removing passengers is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications to reservation H9ZU1C, such as updating passenger information, changing flights, changing cabin class, or adding checked bags. Let me know how you'd like to proceed.\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, let me pull up the reservation details to verify the information.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"H9ZU1C\", \"user_id\": \"mia_kim_4397\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT192\", \"origin\": \"MIA\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 174}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT166\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 125}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1977-02-03\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ethan\", \"last_nam