{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "38#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Noah Muller. I'm calling because I'm really frustrated about my most recent flight being delayed \u2014 it completely threw off my plans and I want to talk about it.\nYes, sure \u2014 my user ID is noah_muller_9847.\nActually, I'd like to go with option 3 \u2014 I do want compensation for that delay, it really messed up my schedule.\n\nBut wait, hold on \u2014 you said this reservation only has 1 passenger? That's not right at all. There are 3 of us on that booking! I'm absolutely certain about that.\nNo, I'm", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear your flight was delayed. To help you with this, I'll need to look up your account and reservation details. Could you please provide your user ID? (It usually looks something like \"noah_muller_123\".)\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"noah_muller_9847\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"889 Hillcrest Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 254\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CO\", \"zip\": \"80243\"}, \"email\": \"noah.muller2290@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1963-01-22\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_1245537\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1245537\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"1167\"}, \"credit_card_6040264\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6040264\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2076\"}, \"credit_card_3255100\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3255100\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2604\"}, \"certificate_8301303\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8301303\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"credit_card_3983998\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3983998\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"8413\"}, \"credit_card_7574394\": {\"source\": \"credi