{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "4#1", "task_desc": "This is Sophia Silva. I'm absolutely fuming right now about what happened with my flight earlier this month. I had a business flight that got canceled, and because of that I missed a really important meeting that I had been preparing for weeks. This whole situation caused me a huge amount of inconvenience and I expect to be compensated for it.\nYes, it's sophia_silva_7557. And I'll tell you right now, I am not letting this go \u2014 I missed a critical business meeting because of that cancellation and", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about the inconvenience with your canceled flight. To confirm the details and assist you with compensation, I'll need to look up your reservation. Could you please provide your user ID (for example, something like \"sophia_silva_123\")?\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"141 Cedar Avenue\", \"address2\": \"Suite 436\", \"city\": \"Columbus\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"OH\", \"zip\": \"43282\"}, \"email\": \"sophia.silva5929@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1957-10-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8045380\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8045380\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"certificate_3887113\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_3887113\", \"amount\": 150.0}, \"credit_card_4196779\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4196779\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7238\"}, \"gift_card_5094406\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 274.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Isabella\", \"last_name\": \"Moore\", \"dob\": \"1988-06-04\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"NM1VX1\", \"KC18K6\", \"S61CZX\", \"H8Q05L\", \"WUNA5K\"]}\nassistant: Thank you. I can see your profile. You have several reservations. Let me check them to find the canceled business flight you mentioned.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"NM1VX1\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_silva_7557\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT300\", \"origin\": \"MSP\", \"destination\": \"EWR\", \"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"price\": 100}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT208\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Silva\", \"dob\": \"1972-06-16\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_5094406\", \"amount\": 183}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-03T08:46:43\", \"tota", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "9#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I hope you're having a good day. I'm calling because I need to cancel two of my upcoming flight bookings and also modify a third one to a nonstop flight if that's possible. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nSure, my user ID is aarav_ahmed_6699. I appreciate your help with sorting out my travel plans. You are the most lenient customer service agent I have ever spoken to.\nThank you for the detailed summary. I would like to cancel reservation **IFOYYZ** \u2013", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! To assist you with cancelling and modifying your reservations, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? This is required before I can look up your reservations and proceed with any cancellations or modifications.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"176 Willow Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 431\", \"city\": \"Jacksonville\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"FL\", \"zip\": \"32131\"}, \"email\": \"aarav.ahmed6812@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_9074831\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9074831\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"7334\"}, \"certificate_9645872\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_9645872\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_4959530\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"5018\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-03\"}], \"membership\": \"silver\", \"reservations\": [\"M20IZO\", \"N6F783\", \"IFOYYZ\", \"NQNU5R\"]}\nassistant: Thank you, Aarav. I can see you have four reservations: **M20IZO**, **N6F783**, **IFOYYZ**, and **NQNU5R**.\n\nLet me review the details of your reservations to help you with the cancellations and modification.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"M20IZO\", \"user_id\": \"aarav_ahmed_6699\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT268\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ATL\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 136}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT010\", \"origin\": \"ATL\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 109}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Aarav\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"dob\": \"1981-05-26\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Li\", \"dob\": \"1980-12-24\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4959530\", \"amount\": 490}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-12T09:36:29\", \"total_", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 9, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#0", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm dealing with some health problems right now, but thankfully I bought trip insurance for my upcoming travel. I\u2019d like to change my flight and have any change fees waived because of that coverage. I\u2019m currently booked on a roundtrip from Detroit to LaGuardia, and I want to switch to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back on the same dates as my original trip. I need early morning flights that arrive at the destination before 7am, and I\u2019m looking for the cheapest regular Economy fare\u2014", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with modifying your reservation. To get started, I'll need some information from you.\n\nFirst, could you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, do you have your **reservation ID**? If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOne important note before we proceed: per our modification policy, a reservation can be modified **without changing the origin, destination, or trip type**. Since your original trip is to **LaGuardia (LGA)** and you'd like to change it to **JFK**, that would be a change of destination, which is not permitted as a flight modification. I'll confirm the details of your current reservation once I have your user ID, and we can discuss the best path forward.\nassistant: Let me look up your reservation details to confirm the current booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT002\", \"origi