{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "34#0", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm Yara Garcia. I have a reservation under the code HXDUBJ and I need to make some changes to my trip. I\u2019d like to change my upcoming outgoing flight to a nonstop flight that departs the next day, and also move my return from SFO back by one day. On top of that, I want to upgrade the ticket to business class and add two checked bags. I\u2019m looking to do all of this as one complete package of changes. Can you help me with that?\nThanks for laying that out. I do have a time preference I shoul", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'll help you with these changes. First, let me look up your reservation details to understand the current booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"HXDUBJ\", \"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT085\", \"origin\": \"IAH\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 177}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT023\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"SFO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 146}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT278\", \"origin\": \"SFO\", \"destination\": \"IAH\", \"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"price\": 180}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\", \"dob\": \"1974-08-15\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_6941833\", \"amount\": 533}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-04T06:04:48\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"yes\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me get your user profile and search for the available flights you need.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"yara_garcia_1905\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Yara\", \"last_name\": \"Garcia\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"377 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 694\", \"city\": \"Denver\", \"country\": \"US