{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "6#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm having a bit of a problem with my upcoming trip. I'm almost certain I purchased travel insurance when I booked my flight, but when I log in and look at my booking details online, there's no sign of it anywhere. I'm traveling with my family, and everyone else in my group already has insurance coverage on their reservations, so I really need to make sure mine gets sorted out and has that insurance added too.\nMy user ID is sophia_taylor_9065, and the reservation number is PEP4E0.\n\nBut I rea", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I understand your concern about the travel insurance. However, I need to let you know that per our airline policy, **travel insurance cannot be added after the initial booking has been made**. I'm not able to add insurance to an existing reservation, so I'm unable to fulfill that specific request.\n\nThat said, since you believe you may have purchased insurance at the time of booking, I can help verify the current status of your reservation to confirm whether insurance is already included.\n\nTo do that, could you please provide:\n- Your **user ID** (e.g., `sara_doe_496`)\n- Your **reservation ID** (e.g., `ZFA04Y`)\n\nIf you don't know your reservation ID, just let me know your user ID and I can help locate it for you.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\