{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "18#0", "task_desc": "Ugh, honestly this is a bit infuriating, but I've run into some money troubles recently. I need to downgrade every business class flight I have booked to economy. I don't want to change any of the flights themselves or the passenger names \u2013 just the cabin class. Can you help me sort this out?\nYeah, fine. My user ID is omar_davis_3817. Look, I know none of these flights have been flown yet \u2014 I just need to get them all downgraded to economy so I can get some money back. This whole money situation", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry to hear about your situation. I can certainly help you downgrade your business class reservations to economy, as long as none of the flights have already been flown.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** so I can locate your reservations. Could you please provide that?\nassistant: Let me look up your profile and reservations to find the business class bookings.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"omar_davis_3817\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Omar\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"281 Spruce Street\", \"address2\": \"Suite 942\", \"city\": \"San Diego\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"92164\"}, \"email\": \"omar.davis7857@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1982-10-19\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_3481935\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3481935\", \"amount\": 22.0}, \"credit_card_2929732\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_2929732\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7803\"}, \"credit_card_9525117\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_9525117\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"2172\"}, \"gift_card_6847880\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_6847880\", \"amount\": 31.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Juan\", \"last_name\": \"Ahmed\", \"d