{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "26#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I need to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT. I want a refund for it.\nSure, my user ID is amelia_sanchez_4739. I don't have the reservation ID handy at the moment, but I'm hoping you can pull it up with that. I really need to cancel that MCO to CLT flight and get my refund processed.\nI understand what you're telling me about the policy, but I really don't accept that. I am telling you I want to cancel my flight from MCO to CLT and I insist on getting my refund. I don't care about those cond", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you cancel your flight and process a refund, I'll need some information first.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you have your **reservation ID** handy, please share that as well. If you don't know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"225 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 563\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"91292\"}, \"email\": \"amelia.sanchez3631@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4065275\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"3658\"}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"3FRNFB\", \"Q4L9HS\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have two reservations: **3FRNFB** and **Q4L9HS**. Let me check the details of both to find the MCO to CLT flight.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"3FRNFB\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT028\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"BOS\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 79}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT277\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"CLT\", \"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"price\": 64}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Amelia\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1955-02-01\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Martin\", \"dob\": \"1973-08-20\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4065275\", \"amount\": 286}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-06T13:25:06\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"Q4L9HS\", \"user_id\": \"amelia_sanchez_4739\", \"origin\": \"EWR\", \"destination\": \"SEA\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"business\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT213\", ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 6, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "11#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I'm James Patel. I need to get this done fast. I have round-trip flights from Las Vegas to Denver, leaving May 19 and coming back May 20. I want to remove a passenger, Sophia, from that reservation. I need the entire fare refunded to my original payment method. How much would that refund be? I don't have my reservation number on me at the moment.\nUgh, this is so frustrating. I don't have time for this nonsense. If you can't remove Sophia, then just downgrade everyone on that reservation to b", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'm sorry, but I'm unable to fulfill this request. According to our policy, while passenger details (such as names or dates of birth) can be modified, the number of passengers on a reservation cannot be changed \u2014 and this restriction applies even to human agents. Removing Sophia from the reservation would reduce the passenger count, which is not permitted.\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you with other modifications that don't change the number of passengers, such as updating passenger information, changing flights, changing cabin class, or adding checked bags. Please let me know how you'd like to proceed.\nassistant: I understand the urgency. To locate your reservation and process the cabin downgrade, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, a format like `james_patel_123`). Could you please provide that?\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can look up your reservation, confirm the current cabin and pricing, and calculate the refund difference for downgrading everyone to basic economy. Please note that before making any changes, I'll need to list the action details and get your explicit confirmation to proceed.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"james_patel_9828\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Patel\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"656 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 768\", \"city\": \"Los Angeles\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"CA\", \"zip\": \"90357\"}, \"email\": \"james.patel1360@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1995-04-07\", \"payment_methods\": {\"gift_card_1642017\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_1642017\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"James\", \"last_name\": \"Sanchez\", \"dob\": \"1956-08-18\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Ava\", \"last_name\": \"Rossi\", \"dob\": \"1973-11-14\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"AAVMM8\", \"MQHHT6\", \"GV1N64\"]}\nassistant: I found your profile. You have three reservations (AAVMM8, MQHHT6, GV1N64). Let me locate the one matching your Las Vegas\u2013Denver round trip. I'll check each one.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": ", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 8, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "12#1", "task_desc": "Hi there. I have an upcoming flight booked and I need to make a couple of changes to my reservation\u2014specifically, I'm looking to change the cabin class for all the passengers on the booking, and I also want to add some checked bags. Can you help me with that?\nSure, my user ID is chen_lee_6825. And yes, I have the reservation ID right here\u2014it's YAX4DR. The flight is from Boston to Minneapolis.\nThanks for confirming the details. I'd like to change the cabin class for both passengers\u2014myself (Chen L", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I'd be happy to help you with changing the cabin class and adding checked bags. \n\nTo get started, I'll need your user ID. Also, do you have your reservation ID handy? If not, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me pull up your reservation details to review the current booking.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"YAX4DR\", \"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT235\", \"origin\": \"BOS\", \"destination\": \"MCO\", \"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"price\": 122}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT298\", \"origin\": \"MCO\", \"destination\": \"MSP\", \"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"price\": 127}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Chen\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1967-12-12\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Noah\", \"last_name\": \"Hernandez\", \"dob\": \"1968-01-06\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_4938634\", \"amount\": 498}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T23:00:15\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}\nassistant: Let me also review your user profile to confirm your membership level and available payment methods.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"chen_lee_6825\