{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "25#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I need to book a flight for my friend Ivan Smith. It should match my existing reservation exactly. Could you assist me with that?\nSure, my user ID is ivan_muller_7015.\nOkay, let me clarify a few things:\n\n- For the passenger, I only want **Ivan Smith** on this new booking \u2014 just him, no one else.\n- The date of birth you pulled from my profile, 1986-03-14, should be right. He's saved in my profile so I'll trust that even though I don't remember it off the top of my head.\n- I do **not** want an", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: To help you book a flight matching your existing reservation, I'll need some information first. \n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? This will allow me to look up your existing reservation and profile details.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"ivan_muller_7015\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"256 Pine Lane\", \"address2\": \"Suite 661\", \"city\": \"New York\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"NY\", \"zip\": \"10029\"}, \"email\": \"ivan.muller6623@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1968-04-25\", \"payment_methods\": {\"certificate_8998287\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_8998287\", \"amount\": 500.0}, \"credit_card_3563913\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_3563913\", \"brand\": \"mastercard\", \"last_four\": \"6710\"}, \"gift_card_8516878\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_8516878\", \"amount\": 128.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Ivan\", \"last_name\": \"Smith\", \"dob\": \"1986-03-14\"}, {\"first_name\": \"Lucas\", \"last_name\": \"Davis\", \"dob\": \"1988-10-12\"}], \"membership\": \"gold\", \"reservations\": [\"G72NSF\"]}\nassistant: Let me look up your existing reservation to understand the details we need to match.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\"