{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "20#1", "task_desc": "Hello, I'm looking to book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\nSure, my user ID is mia_li_3668. As for the New York airport, I don't have a specific one in mind \u2014 any of the New York airports would be fine, so whatever works for the flight options.\nActually, both of those flights depart before 11am EST \u2014 HAT069 at 6am and HAT083 at 1am \u2014 and I'd really prefer not to fly that early in the morning. I'm fine with a flight that has one stopover if that means a later departure time", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello! I'd be happy to help you book a one-way flight from New York to Seattle on May 20th.\n\nTo get started, I'll need your **user ID** (for example, something like \"sara_doe_496\"). Could you please provide that?\n\nAlso, just to confirm the airports: New York has a few airports (JFK, LGA, EWR) and Seattle is SEA. Please let me know which New York airport you'd like to depart from, or I can help you search options.\nassistant: Thank you! Let me look up your profile and search for available flights.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"mia_li_3668\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Mia\", \"last_name\": \"Li\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"975 Sunset Drive\", \"address2\": \"Suite 217\", \"city\": \"Austin\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"78750\"}, \"email\": \"mia.li3818@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1990-04-05\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_4421486\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_4421486\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"7447\"}, \"certificate_4856383\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_4856383\", \"amount\": 100.0}, \"certificate_7504069\": {\"source\": \"certificate\", \"id\": \"certificate_7504069\", \"amount\": 250.0}, \"credit_card_1955700\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_1955700\