{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "31#1", "task_desc": "Hi, I have a flight booked out of JFK on May 17, but I need to get back home earlier because my cat is very sick. I\u2019d like to change it to a nonstop flight if that\u2019s possible.\nSure, my user ID is daiki_lee_6144. I\u2019m sorry but I don\u2019t have my reservation ID handy \u2014 I don\u2019t know what it is. Can you look it up with my user ID?\nThank you, please transfer me to a human agent who can help with my urgent situation. ###TRANSFER###", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: I can help you with that. First, I'll need some information to locate your reservation.\n\nCould you please provide your **user ID**? \n\nAlso, if you know your **reservation ID**, please share that as well. If you don't have it, I can help look it up once I have your user ID.\ntool: {\"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"name\": {\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\"}, \"address\": {\"address1\": \"410 River Road\", \"address2\": \"Suite 380\", \"city\": \"Fort Worth\", \"country\": \"USA\", \"state\": \"TX\", \"zip\": \"76173\"}, \"email\": \"daiki.lee6987@example.com\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\", \"payment_methods\": {\"credit_card_6198952\": {\"source\": \"credit_card\", \"id\": \"credit_card_6198952\", \"brand\": \"visa\", \"last_four\": \"9734\"}, \"gift_card_3112961\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 51.0}, \"gift_card_5128346\": {\"source\": \"gift_card\", \"id\": \"gift_card_5128346\", \"amount\": 262.0}}, \"saved_passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Raj\", \"last_name\": \"Muller\", \"dob\": \"1967-10-16\"}], \"membership\": \"regular\", \"reservations\": [\"DF89BM\", \"COVE6R\", \"IIHXDG\"]}\nassistant: I found your user profile. You have three reservations: **DF89BM**, **COVE6R**, and **IIHXDG**. Let me check the details of each to find the one departing from JFK on May 17.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"DF89BM\", \"user_id\": \"daiki_lee_6144\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT079\", \"origin\": \"JFK\", \"destination\": \"ORD\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 63}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT020\", \"origin\": \"ORD\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 78}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT263\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"JFK\", \"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"price\": 53}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Daiki\", \"last_name\": \"Lee\", \"dob\": \"1976-10-08\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"gift_card_3112961\", \"amount\": 194}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-01T23:25:01\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insur", "failure_mode": "user_stop", "tool_calls": 4, "fb_mode": "env", "error": "", "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "method": "tau2_llm_agent", "code_rev": "c20b97c0", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "env", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T09:59:25"}
{"benchmark": "tau2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "29#1", "task_desc": "Hello, this is Raj Brown. I\u2019m dealing with a health problem right now, and fortunately I bought trip insurance for my upcoming travel. Because of that, I\u2019d like to change my flights and have any change fees waived. I currently have a roundtrip reservation from Detroit to LaGuardia, and I want to switch it to nonstop flights from Detroit to JFK and back, keeping the same travel dates. I need early morning flights that get in before 7 AM, and I\u2019m looking for the least expensive Economy (not Basic ", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "response": "assistant: Hi! How can I help you today?\nassistant: Hello Raj, I\u2019m sorry to hear about your health problem, and I\u2019m glad you have travel insurance in place. I\u2019d be happy to help you look into changing your flights and adding a checked bag.\n\nBefore I can look up your reservation and search for flights, I\u2019ll need a couple of details from you:\n\n1. **Your user ID** (for example, something like `raj_brown_123`). This is required to access your profile and reservations.\n2. **Your reservation ID** (for example, `ZFA04Y`), if you have it. If you don\u2019t know it, I can help locate it once I have your user ID.\n\nOnce I have your user ID, I can pull up your current roundtrip reservation (Detroit \u2192 LaGuardia) to confirm the travel dates, then search for the least expensive nonstop Economy flights from Detroit to JFK and back that arrive before 7 AM on those same dates.\ntool: {\"reservation_id\": \"VA5SGQ\", \"user_id\": \"raj_brown_5782\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"flight_type\": \"round_trip\", \"cabin\": \"economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT035\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 163}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT066\", \"origin\": \"PHX\", \"destination\": \"LGA\", \"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"price\": 184}, {\"fli